// ********** [EV] EVENTS **********************************************************
	// EVENT REMI: Railroad Intro CODE: 10310001
	"remi.railroadIntro.1": "...$6#$b#You can see me? That's weird.",
	"remi.railroadIntro.2": "If you're here, that means I can leave this place.#$b#Thing is, the path was blocked when I first got here.#$b#So, I stood out here for who knows how long until something happens.$11",
	"remi.railroadIntro.3": "You think that's strange?$6#$b#Huh, I guess it is for most people.",
	"remi.railroadIntro.4": "Look, the moment you lose sight of me, you'll forget me and everything I've said.$6#$b#So, none of this matters, m'kay?",
	"remi.railroadIntro.5": "Anyways, now that the path is clear I can get to moving in a bit.#$b#Who knows, maybe I'll smell you around again. Hehe.$11",


	// EVENT Remi and Oarfish at the Beach after Intro CODE: 10310002
	"both.beachAfterIntro.1": "Hey.#$b#Smelled ya coming from a mile away.$9",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.2": "...$7#$b#%She waved at you.",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.3": "Let me guess. She ignored you until now.$11#$b#Yup. That's Oarfish.",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.4": "By the way, thanks for poking me awake back at the railroad.$11#$b#I'd never know the path down to the mountain would be open otherwise.#$b#For all I know, I'd be standing there sleeping until the end of time.$9",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.5": "Hey, I just noticed now. You remember me, don't you?$10",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.6": "Well, that's great news! Hope it lasts, though.$h#$b#You're something weird, aren't you?#$b#Your scent gives it away$11.",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.7": "Haha, is the smelling thing getting too much?$9#$b#I might as well tell you since you can see and remember me. I'm blind and deaf.",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.8": "...!$h",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.9": "And Fish here is mute.$11",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.10": "You probably got a lot of questions on your mind right now.#$b#Let's just say, aside from how you smell, I can sense your general desires. Kind of like mind-reading but on a subconcious level.#$b#I'll elaborate further one day when I feel like it.$11",
	"both.beachAfterIntro.11": "Hehe, don't think much of it right now. Just treat us like you would to anybody else.$11#$b#And remember that you're free to hang out with us anytime.#$b#Fish will definitely be a lot nicer to you from now on.$9",


	// EVENT Remi and Oarfish 3 Hearts at the Saloon on Saturday CODE: 10314001
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.1": "Heya, smelled you coming in.$11#$b#So, you here on your own? You can hang out with us.",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.2": ".....$a",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.3": "Hmm? Oh yeah.#$b#Fish is really upset about something.#$b#Hehe, is she losing too many lives again?$11",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.4": "...!!$a#$b#%Oarfish is deeply engrossed in the arcade game.",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.5": "Fish and I come here on Tuesdays and Saturdays just so you know.#$b#By the time the air feels a tad cooler, that's when I know it's evening.$11",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.6": "...$u#$b#...!!$6#$b#%Oarfish advanced to the next level!",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.7": "How do I know if it's Tuesday or Saturday?$11#$b#Well, I've been working on trying to tell which day of the week it is through patterns, atmospheric changes, smells, et cetera, et cetera...#$b#But I'm not about to bore you with the technical details. Let's eat!$9",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.8": "...#$b#%It seems like she's out of lives.",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.9": "[206]We ordered pizza. Feel free to take a slice.#$q 10311013 null#You want beer to go with that?#$r 10311013 100 Event_saloonTakeBeer#Free beer? Sure!#$r 10311014 50 Event_saloonStaySobber#No thanks. Still got work to do.#$r 10311015 50 Event_saloonNotADrinker#No thanks. I don't drink alcohol.",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.10": "...We steer clear of this place on Fridays. Smells awful on those nights.$7#$b#Have I ever told you I hate the way humans smell? I don't know why either, I just don't like it.$6",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.11": "Well then, enough about me.$11#$b#You got stories to share?",

	"both.saloonOnSaturday.Answer1": "[346] Here ya go.$9#$b#Looks like you and I are gonna be getting along pretty well.",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.Answer2": "Gotcha. Fish is the same. She'll need a clear head to beat this thing.#$b#Must be a pretty tough arcade game, huh?.$11",
	"both.saloonOnSaturday.Answer3": "Oh? Okay, I'll try to remember that.#$b#...I hope. If I offer you the stuff again, it's not out of malice or anything. I just got a really bad head on my shoulders.$6",


	// EVENT Remi and Oarfish 5 Hearts at the Beach, Remi drowning CODE: 10314002
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.1": "WaaaAAAaaaHHH!$13",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.2": "...$8",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.3": "Fiiiiiiiish!$13",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.4": "Bwah! Huh!?$13#$b#@! Is that you? Help meeee!!$13",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.5": "Huh, it's actually not that deep.$10",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.6": "...ugh.$7",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.7": "...$a",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.8": "...?$7",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.9": "...$a",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.10": "...$6#$b#...sigh.$7",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.11": "Oarfish. That was mean.$6#$b#...You know I'm scared of the ocean.$7",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.12": "...",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.13": "...$10",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.14": "...sigh.$7#$b#Sorry you had to see that.$6",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.15": "It's all good. Fish and I have always been this way.#$b#In fact, our first contact with each other involves her submerging me in really deep waters.$11#$b#...it's why I'm scared of the ocean.$7",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.16": "It isn't like we can drown. I just get very nervous in deep waters since it's difficult to navigate.$7",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.17": "What if I end up in the middle of nowhere? Of nothing but the endless smell of salty seas?$8",
	"both.beachRemiDrowning.18": "...Uwaahh, so horrifying...$13",


	// EVENT Remi and Oarfish 7 Hearts at the Mines CODE: 10314003
	"both.minesOnFridays.1": "Well that was good exercise.$11#$b#As always, you, my sweet, kick a lot of butt.",
	"both.minesOnFridays.2": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish beams with pride.",
	"both.minesOnFridays.3": "So...#$b#Another round?$12",
	"both.minesOnFridays.4": "...$8",
	"both.minesOnFridays.5": "Whoo! That was great!$h#$b#...?$10#$b#Oh. Hi, @. You smell like you've been through hell and back.",
	"both.minesOnFridays.6": "Wanna take a look at our haul?$9",
	"both.minesOnFridays.7": "Ehehe. Impressive, no?$11#$b#I sniff and dig out the rocks and she covers my six. We're a pretty good duo.",
	"both.minesOnFridays.8": "...!$h",
	"both.minesOnFridays.9": "[72]Have a freebie.#$b#Fish and I don't really need too much of this stuff. We come to the mines for the fun and excitement of it.$11",
	"both.minesOnFridays.10": "Although, sometimes we gotta sell the shiny stuff to humans for coin so we can buy other stuff.$6#$b#We know that in this planet, we can't just take the goods off the shelves as we please.",
	"both.minesOnFridays.11": "Even then, *I* can always take the goods as I please. The shopkeep wouldn't remember me anyways.$11#$b#It's always a perfect crime.$12",
	"both.minesOnFridays.12": "...",
	"both.minesOnFridays.13": "Ow!!",
	"both.minesOnFridays.14": "Yeah, yeah okay! We'll be good citizens, Fish. I promise! Oww, ow ow, stop!$13",
	"both.minesOnFridays.15": "Remi: Ow... Oh right!",
	"both.minesOnFridays.16": "By the way, Fish and I go mine here every Friday night.#$b#If you catch us then, we'll be sure to have a piece for you.$9",


	// EVENT Remi and Oarfish 9 Hearts at the Forest CODE: 10314004
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.1": "...$6#$b#Fish?$6",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.2": "...?$7",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.3": "We've been on Earth for a while now, and I've gotten used to the smell...$6",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.4": "Have you ever thought of going back home?$6#$b#I mean, we can always come back here whenever we want, but what I meant is home-home, y'know?",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.5": "...$6#$b#Yeah, a little longer, I think.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.6": "...Fish.$6#$b#I really don't want to forget.$6#$b#We're here because I had to lengthen my sentence, right?",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.7": "...",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.8": "I was afraid you'd forget me soon, even if it was for another 500 years.$6#$b#I don't feel time passing, but I just have to make sure I get you to never forget me.$6#$b#And what other way to make sure I'm a convict forever other than staying in a place I shouldn't be in?$9",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.9": "Is all that correct, Oarfish?$6#$b#I wanted to make sure.$6",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.10": "...$7",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.11": "I'm glad.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.12": "sigh...<",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.13": "@, I know you're there.$6#$b#Come out from that bush and stand here with us, why don't 'cha?$11",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.14": "I bet you heard things?#$b#Great, you're up to speed.$9",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.15": "Fish and I were just doing our routine memory check.#$b#Don't wanna forget the reason why we're here.$11",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.16": "If I did, I'd simply wonder why I'm on a stinky planet and immediately take myself back home.$6",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.17": "...",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.18": "Of course I'd find you first before going home, haha! Silly Fish, I wouldn't forget about you!$h#$b#...$8",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.19": "Phew....",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.20": "Hm? Yeah. I'm a convict.#$b#My crime? Being too cute.$11",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.21": "Ouch! Ahaha, okay it's almost *accidentally* destroying Earth.$11",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.22": "Long story short, I'm sentenced to over 500 years of not being allowed to enter this planet.#$b#And as you can see, I went against that order.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.23": "Oarfish can only see and remember me purely because I'm a criminal. It comes with her job as a court executioner back home.$6",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.24": "What? Oarfish is super nice!$9#$b#She's a real sweetheart outside of her job.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.25": "...",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.26": "...?$u#$b#%Oarfish pulled out a small pocket watch and read the time.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.27": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish waves at you to call your attention.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.28": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish gestures to trade places with her.",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.29": "Hey, you guys are shuffling around.$6#$b#It's kinda making me nervous.$6",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.30": "Fiiiiiish!!!$13",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.31": "Ug!! Uwaah! The pond's actually deep this time!!!$13",
	"both.forestOnWednesdays.32": "These two...",


	// EVENT Remi 2 Hearts: Meeting again at the Railroad CODE: 10310003
	"remi.2Hearts.1": "...$6#$b#Oh, it's you again.",
	"remi.2Hearts.2": "So, do you just come here to talk to me for a bit,$6#$b#and maybe hand me a few goodies before running off to whatever you gotta do?$6",
	"remi.2Hearts.3": "Not that I mind.#$b#It's nice to have some fleeting company sometimes.#$b#And the gifts you shove in my hands are really nice, too.$9",
	"remi.2Hearts.4": "Is that how humans go about things?$6#$b#Talking and sometimes giving gifts that build fondness towards a person...$6",
	"remi.2Hearts.5": "Becoming fond of someone... It's not that different from where I came from.#$b#At least, from the very few friends I had back there.#$b#Fish is the only one that followed me here...#$b#I think.$7",
	"remi.2Hearts.6": "Yeah, you probably know by now that me and Fish aren't from around here.$11#$b#You don't seem bothered by it, though. You're really weird.",
	"remi.2Hearts.7": "Hey, I appreciate you just coming here to see me.#$b#I know I said that you'd forget me the first time you found me here, but you proved me wrong.$9",
	"remi.2Hearts.8": "So... yeah. I'm not sure how else I'm going to entertain you.$6#$b#And you might have some other things you gotta do.#$b#Go on. I won't be keeping you for much longer.$11",


	// EVENT Remi 4 Hearts: Stealing from Pierre Parte 1 CODE: 10310004
	// Pierre
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.1": "YOU!!$3",
	// Remi
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.2": "Oops! Hehe.$11",
	// Pierre
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.3": "You haven't paid for those! You think you can just steal from my store?$3#$b#Get back here!$3",
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.4": "Oh, farmer @! Good to see you.$1#$b#Here to buy some seeds, I bet. Feel free to browse.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.5": "...Why am I standing out here?$4#$b#What was I doing again?$2",
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.6": "Oh, don't mind me!$1#$b#I think I'm just having one of those days where you space out and forget things, know what I mean?#$b#I'll be right behind the counter when you need me.",
	// Remi
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.7": "Psst! @, over here.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.8": "Hehe, he completely forgot about me.$11",
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.9": "Meet me outside when you're done shopping. I got something to show you.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.10": "See ya, Mr. Shopkeep!$h",
	// Pierre
	"remi.4HeartsPart1.11": "Erm, umm,$4#$b#Sure! Come back anytime.$1",


	// EVENT Remi 4 Hearts: Stealing from Pierre Parte 2 CODE: 10310005
	//Remi
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.1": "There you are. Follow me.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.2": "Here, take this.#$b#I sniffed this one out from an aisle. [485]Smells kinda funky, though.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.3": "Yeah, yeah, I stole this one from the shop. It was about to go to waste anyways.$11#$q 10311009 null#So are you gonna tell me off about it?#$r 10311009 0 Event_remisteal1#Remi, stealing is against the law.#$r 10311010 0 Event_remisteal2#Free seeds? I'll take it.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.Answer1": "Aww, what a goodie two-shoes~!.$11#$b#It's too late to return it now, though. He'll be asking questions.#$b#I guess you can always give him a tip the next time you shop there.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.Answer2": "Oh? That's a surprise. I like your style!$9#$b#I only take low value items, though. Especially the ones that smell like they're going to rot soon.",
	// Refer to remi_dialogue.json for "Event_remisteal1" and "Event_remisteal2"
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.4": "Anyways, you noticed how Mr. Shopkeep was standing there when you came in, right?#$b#That's because he was trying to catch me for stealing that seed packet I gave you.#$b#I went around the aisle and as soon as he lost sight of me, his memories of me are erased.$11",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.5": "It just happened that I smelled you coming in right at that moment.#$b#And I found that to be the perfect opportunity to demonstrate what I meant by people either not seeing me or forgetting me immediately.",
	// Harvey
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.6": "Oh, it's farmer @. Good to see you.#$b#Don't overwork yourself, alright?$1",
	//Remi
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.7": "See? He noticed only you.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.8": "Some people see me, some don't see me at all.#$b#It doesn't matter if posters of my face are plastered everywhere.#$b#In the end, the moment they look away, I am forgotten.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.9": "But that's the thing. You remember me!$h#$b#It's a pretty big deal to me when I find another person who can see and remember my existence.$9#$b#As you'd guess, something like that doesn't happen a lot for me.",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.10": "Sorry if I come off as too eager to be buddies with you.$11#$b#I mean, if the people that can remember me are the only ones I can be friends with, then I gotta treat them good, right?",
	"remi.4HeartsPart2.11": "So yeah. In short, I want to be friends with you.#$b#And I'll put in effort to keep this friendship with you. Just as how you've been talking to me and giving me gifts sometimes.$9",


	// EVENT Remi 6 Hearts: Dream Warping CODE: 10310006
	"remi.6Hearts.1": "...hm?",
	"remi.6Hearts.2": "I knew something smells off.#$b#@, what are you doing here?$9",
	"remi.6Hearts.3": "So you just went to your farm and then you're here?$6#$b#Hmm... Are you sure you're not dreaming?$6",
	"remi.6Hearts.4": "Still, I think I should explain what's going on.$11#$b#I'm doing some preparations. Nothing too big or dangerous or anything like that.",
	"remi.6Hearts.5": "I'll admit. For the likes of you, this place is pretty boring. Nothing much to see or do here.$6",
	"remi.6Hearts.6": "Hmm...$6#$b#Yeah, that'll work.",
	"remi.6Hearts.7": "Since we're \"dreaming\", how about we go somewhere fun?$9#$b#Come closer to this thingy here why don't 'cha?",
	"remi.6Hearts.8": "Alright, we're ready to go.#$b#On three. One... Two...$11",
	"remi.6Hearts.9": "Hmmm...$6#$b#Nope.",
	"remi.6Hearts.10": "Oops, uh oh...$8#$b#...m-my head...$8",
	"remi.6Hearts.11": "Right. Let's get out of here.$6",
	"remi.6Hearts.12": "Hm! This place smells nice!$9",
	"remi.6Hearts.13": "...!$8",
	"remi.6Hearts.14": "Aaaahh... No no no no nonononono NO!!$13",
	"remi.6Hearts.15": "Hah... Hah... That was scary...$13",
	"remi.6Hearts.16": "*sniff* *sniff*$10#$b#Oh, hey Fish!$h",
	"remi.6Hearts.17": "Ehehe...$l#$b#Yep. You're \"dream\" Oarfish, alright.",
	"remi.6Hearts.18": "Okay, let's go.",
	"remi.6Hearts.19": "Hey, you're standing on my spot.$9",
	"remi.6Hearts.20": "Nah, we don't need to trade places.$11",
	"remi.6Hearts.21": "I think that's enough dream warping for now.",
	"remi.6Hearts.22": "So yeah, I'm preparing some stuff.$11#$b#And when I'm done, I'll show you.",
	"remi.6Hearts.23": "I'm still not sure how you stumbled into my dream void, though.$6#$b#I swear you're something weird, @!$9",
	"remi.6Hearts.24": "I get the feeling you want to \"wake up\" now.#$b#Here, I'll warp you back home.",


	// EVENT Remi 8 Hearts Part 1: Backwoods Invitation CODE: 10310007
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.1": "*sniiiiff...*",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.2": "Aaaahhh...",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.3": "Hiya, your farm smells nice.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.4": "Anyways, ermm...#$b#Why am I here again?$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.5": "Oh, right!$10#$b#This is about what I was working on when we were dream warping.$9#$b#If you got the time, could you come to the woods behind your farm? Any day would do.#$b#It doesn't matter how long it would take you. I can literally wait for an eternity.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.6": "*whiiiiffff...*",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.7": "Aaaahhh...",
	"remi.8HeartsPart1.8": "Right. See ya.$9",


	// EVENT Remi 8 Hearts Part 2: Lost Garden CODE: 10310008
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.1": "Here you are!$h#$b#I just got here, too. I think.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.2": "Right. The thing I wanted to show you.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.3": "Fish told me this spot is very out of the way for anyone else to find.$11#$b#Dunno if your human eyes can see it right now or not, but it's right here.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.4": "C'mon over here, why don't 'cha!$h",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.5": "Now watch closely.#$b#I've set this warp crystal to only respond to me, Fish, and you.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.6": "Just place your palm right at the top of this spot here, aaaand...",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.7": "Hey, you gotta come with me to the other side. I promise it's nothing dangerous.#$b#Come on, let's go!$9",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.8": "So, what do you think?",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.9": "...Yeah, there's nothing much to see here.#$b#Nothing much for me to smell, either.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.10": "This platform is all that's left of this place.#$b#There used to be a garden here. And it was so overgrown that I got buried beneath the roots.#$b#Mom, er... sort of my \"mom\" had to cut them off of me.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.11": "Long ago, something went wrong in my creation process, and I ended up like this.#$b#Blind, deaf, forgetful... forgettable...$11#$b#The only ones that could keep track of me are my mom and my creator.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.12": "Since I was originally designed to be my mom's replacement body in case she's badly damaged, my er... quirks were hardly a problem.#$b#My creator figured it would be much safer to keep me somewhere isolated, like this garden.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.13": "And so, I happily stood here for who knows how long.$9#$b#Due to my incomplete consciousness, I am incapable of sensing the passing of time.#$b#Which means I could stand here for all of eternity, until something happens.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.14": "No one ever comes here, so no one would ever find me.#$b#Which is good, since that means no one could hurt me, and I'll always be intact by the time mom needs me.$9",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.15": "...Mom didn't like that idea.$6#$b#Whenever she finds me here, she'd drag me out of it.$6#$b#But I just kept coming back here so stubbornly, I can imagine how that drove her mad.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.16": "So, one day, she blasted this place into... well, this.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.17": "I got the message, and I never went back here again.#$b#And would you believe she told me to go make some friends instead?$6#$b#Crazy, right? I can't do that when no one else can even remember my face.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.18": "Still, by some miraculous chance, I met my two closest friends.#$b#One has perfect memory. She literally can't forget anything.#$b#Five years later, I met Oarfish. She was especially made to not forget the faces of criminals.#$b#Hehe, and just as you would've guessed, she wouldn't leave me alone.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.19": "And then here you are which, for some weird reason, can see and remember me.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.20": "Due to my conditions, I probably wouldn't make another friend for a long while.#$b#But even if it's only you three, that's more than enough to make me believe I \"exist\", hehe.$9",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.21": "Whoops, was that too heavy? Sorry.$11#$b#But yeah, I'm fine with the whole world ignoring me, so long as there's you guys.#$b#You all mean a lot to me.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.22": "Now, about this place...",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.23": "I'm sure this ol' garden still responds strongly to my desires.$11#$b#I mean, look at you. You're breathing fine.#$b#The garden still forms an atmosphere that allows life to breathe even now.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.24": "Hehe, forgot you're in space, @?$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.25": "C'mon, follow me. I promise you won't fall off.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.26": "Here's the thing.#$b#I know for sure there's nothing but black emptiness out here, but watch this.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.27": "Mmm... something smells good.$u#$b#Oh right, I willed them to be there.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.28": "The garden may be destroyed, but it is still deeply connected to me and my mom's will.#$b#This place can still be whatever I desire it to be.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.29": "Look, you're a farmer. And you make things out of stuff you gather and grow out there.#$b#I think you can make use of this place better than I do.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.30": "Watch me.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.31": "I'm not falling, am I?$9#$b#If you will it, I'll will it, too. And this vast emptiness will listen.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.32": "Life still grows here. And I know you grow a lot of life.#$b#All I'm saying is, I want you to use this place.$11#$b#This void I'm standing on can become what you need it to be, like soil or oxygen or sunlight, #$b#and the seeds you sow here will grow to become real produce.#$b#Super useful! Don't you think?$9",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.33": "Come out in the void with me!$h",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.34": "I promise you'll be fine.",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.35": "See?$9",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.36": "Right. I'll leave it to you how you'd like to fill the void.#$b#Just like how you filled up the void in my heart.$9",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.37": "Yeah yeah, lame. I know. Hehe.$11",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.38": "Remi: Hey, I don't remember if I've said it before but...",
	"remi.8HeartsPart2.39": "Remi: Thank you. I'm glad you found me.",


	// EVENT Remi 10 Hearts: Railroad Talk CODE: 10310010
	"remi.10Hearts.1": "Oh hey. You're finally here.",
	"remi.10Hearts.2": "So the reason I ask you to come here is...",
	"remi.10Hearts.3": "Sorry, I'm just so forgetful today.$11#$b#Alright, serious this time.",
	"remi.10Hearts.4": "Ten hearts means we're best friends, right?",
	"remi.10Hearts.5": "Well, it's just...$7#$b#I'm always so sure about what people desire, but I can never guess what you really want for some reason.$6#$b#And maybe I should've done my research before accepting it but...$7#$b#When you gave me those flowers, you meant us to be platonic best friends, right?",
	"remi.10Hearts.6": "#Are we not an item?#Hm? Yeah, we're best friends.",
	"remi.10Hearts.7": "Well, that's a relief!$9#$b#Sorry if that was a weird way to start. Um...#$q 10311018 null#..You really mean it like that?#$r 10311018 0 Event_remiHadACrush#Maybe I had a little crush earlier on. But I got to like our friendship more.#$r 10311019 0 Event_remiCompletelyPlatonic#Yup. Those flowers are meant to be platonic.",
	"remi.10Hearts.8": "Oh boy, am I so happy!$9#$b#Don't get me wrong. I love Oarfish a lot, but just because you and I aren't smushing faces together doesn't mean you're any less precious to me.#$b#I know for sure my feelings for you aren't romantic... but I love you for real. You get me?",
	"remi.10Hearts.9": "Maybe it's just a me-thing, but I always wanted this kind of friendship with you more than anything.$9#$b#I want to always be here for you, help you with stuff, spoil you and make you happy and all that.$11",
	"remi.10Hearts.10": "I know it's such a silly reason to ask you to come all the way here, so it's really nice of you to show up.$9",
	"remi.10Hearts.11": "@?",
	"remi.10Hearts.12": "Sorry today isn't anything fancy like before.$11#$b#So uh, if it's worth anything...",
	"remi.10Hearts.13": "I love you, @!$h#$b#Thanks for being my best friend!$9",

	// Answers
	"remi.10Hearts.Answer1": "I'm... I'm sorry. I don't like you that way.$s",
	"remi.10Hearts.Answer2": "...$6#$b#Yeah, sounds nice.",
	"remi.10Hearts.Answer3": "Oh!$10#$b#Hehe, I suppose it can happen. Fish tells me I look cute.$11#$b#Guess she's not lying, huh?",
	"remi.10Hearts.Answer4": "Well, this is just fantastic!$h#$b#Gee, it sure feels great to \"hear\" it straight from you.$9",

	//other option
	"remi.10Hearts.14": "...Oh.$8",
	"remi.10Hearts.15": "I'm... sorry.$10",
	"remi.10Hearts.16": "I hope I didn't lead you on or anything.$6#$q 10311016 null#Maybe I should've made it more clear...#$r 10311016 -250 Event_remiPushRomantic#But I really love you. Can't we try to make this work?#$r 10311017 -100 Event_remiWeCanBePlatonic#Oh? Then I'm fine with just being friends.",
	"remi.10Hearts.17": "...ugh, I feel awkward.$7",
	"remi.10Hearts.18": "Thanks for clearing it up for me.#$b#And um, just because I'm not as physical and romantic with you as I do with Fish,$9#$b#that doesn't mean you're any less precious to me.$9",
	"remi.10Hearts.19": "But I guess that's not how it works in your planet, huh...?$7",
	"remi.10Hearts.20": "Again, I'm sorry. But I think I want to be alone right now.$6",
	"remi.10Hearts.21": "U-um...!$10",
	"remi.10Hearts.22": "We're still friends, okay?#$b#Next time I smell you around, I promise we'd be like as we were before.$9",
	"remi.10Hearts.23": "...$6#$b#Huh? Oh, sorry. I'm still feeling a bit awful.$6",


	// EVENT Remi 14 Hearts: Patio Quest Part 1 CODE: 10310011
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.1": "Heya, smell something good?",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.2": "Ehehe. Well, here you go.[201]$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.3": "Actually...",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.4": "I've been thinking. The patio could use a little something more to it, don't you think?#$b#Even I can smell it's kinda empty...$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.5": "Hey, how about I ask you to get some stuff?$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.6": "I know I can just sniff them up from the ground but I gotta involve you somehow.#$b#And I know you got a knack for finding these special things even I can't get my hands on.$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.7": "Right. To improve the patio, we'll need something from the desert.#$b#And then something from the forest, the mountains, and...$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.8": "Whoops, almost spoiled you there! Hehe.$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart1.9": "I'll get Fish to write the list for me.#$b#I promise, once this project is done, the patio's gonna be super useful to you.",


	// EVENT Remi 14 Hearts: Patio Quest Part 2 CODE: 10310012
	"remi.14HeartsPart2.1": "Thanks a lot for helping me with this!$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart2.2": "Well, you're gonna benefit from this, too. So, even better, right?#$b#Anyways, you're going to see the patio change soon-ish.#$b#After that, you should be able to teleport to convenient spots around the valley.$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart2.3": "Didn't I tell ya this project is gonna be super useful?$h#$b#We've been real good housemates to each other for a while now, and I want to give you nothing but the best.",


	// EVENT Remi 14 Hearts: Patio Quest Ginger Island Addition CODE: 10310013
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.1": "Morning, @.",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.2": "Sooo, remember how I said I almost spoiled you?",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.3": "Actually, I think I've been spoiling you way too much already, but I just can't help it, y'know?$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.4": "[904]Here's something special for today. Congrats on getting on the island.$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.5": "Which is exactly why I brought this up.#$b#Remember the patio? I'm still going to work on that.",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.6": "You already know where I'm going with this.$11#$b#I'm going to create a warp point for you to get to the volcanic forge in a flash.",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.7": "Only problem is...$6#$b#...the island's way too far out in the ocean.$7",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.8": "I was about to ask Oarfish buuut I figured to have you do the work instead.#$b#You know the drill. Get me these items and I'll go give the patio another upgrade.$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart3.9": "Hehe, I'll get Fish to writing you that list. Look forward to it.$9",


	// EVENT Remi 14 Hearts: Quest Ginger Island Addition FINISHED CODE: 10310014
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.1": "Awesome work, @! I knew I could count on ya!$h",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.2": "Ginger Island's a bit of a toughie to nail down, but I pulled through.#$b#Hehe, now you can skip paying for a ticket to get there.$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.3": "By the way, @. Just so you know...",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.4": "If you ever decided to kick us out of your house, you won't have that patio anymore.$6#$b#Got it?$6",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.5": "..........",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.6": "Bwahahahaha! I'm just kidding, @!$h#$b#Look, of course I won't take back everything I gave you.#$b#You're human, afterall. You'll get sick of us eventually.$11#$b#...Maybe.",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.7": "If you *do* make us leave, though, the patio would disappear. That's what I'm trying to figure out.$6#$b#But don't worry. I'll make sure you can still have access to those warp points one way or another.#$b#It'll be my parting gift when it comes to it.$9",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.8": "Aww, sorry. All this talk of separating is making me sad, too.$11",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.9": "I'll never be sure of the future, and one day you'll disappear.$s#$b#That's why I'm bringing this up now.$6",
	"remi.14HeartsPart4.10": "But in the meantime, I'm not going anywhere.$9#$b#For as long as you want me to stick around, I'll always be here with you. Okay?",


