	// EVENT Oarfish 6 Hearts: Part 6: Confrontation at the beach CODE: 10312008
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.1": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish seems happy to see you.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.2": "$q 10313001 null#...?#$r 10313001 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts1#Oarfish, we need to talk.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer1": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish is ready to listen.",
	//
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.3": "$q 10313002 null#...#$r 10313002 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts2#Someone's been going around playing mean pranks on people...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer2": "...",
	//
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.4": "$q 10313003 null#...#$r 10313003 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts3#Was it you?#$r 10313004 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts4#I expected better of you!",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer3": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish gestures no.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer4": "...#$b#%Oarfish gestures no, it wasn't her.",
	//
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.5": "$q 10313005 null#...#$r 10313005 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts5#Then, who made that mess back in town?#$r 10313006 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts6#Stop lying. I know it was you.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer5": "...!$3",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer6": "...!$3",
	//
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.6": "...$s#$b#%Oarfish urges you to stand behind her.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.7": "...$a",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.8": "...?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.9": "...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.10": "$q 10313007 null#...#$r 10313007 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts7#What's going on?#$r 10313008 0 Event_oarfish6Hearts8#There's two of you?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer7": "...$a#$b#%Oarfish gestures the double is a threat.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.Answer8": "...$a#$b#%Oarfish gestures the double is a threat.",
	//
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.11": "...Hehehe.$8",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.12": "Bye bye!$h",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.13": "...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.14": "Erm... you two better not stand on that spot.$6#$b#Come up over here.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.15": "...Hm. A doppelganger, huh?$6",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.16": "Hey, @. Why don't you sit with us?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.17": "You can't?$6#$b#Well, that's another problem we'll tackle later.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.18": "...Now that I think about it, it wasn't Oarfish that pushed me into the train's way.$6",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.19": "Yeah, it hurt a lot.#$b#But I'm fine, see?$11",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.20": "...$s",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.21": "I'd wake up in an instant if that was Oarfish, but apparently the doppelganger was able to hide its scent from me.$6",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.22": "And based on your story, it isn't like Fish to consider making a mess infront of someone's house as a prank.#$b#Still, I wouldn't put it past her to push me into the train tracks.$7",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.23": "...!$8#$b#%Oarfish silently giggles to herself.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.24": "Right. How about it, Fish?#$b#Let's go around town, find your double, and kick some doppelganger butt.$11",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.25": "...$7",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.26": "And you...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.27": "Sorry to be lame, @. But it's best you keep your head down for now.$6#$b#Sounds to me that double would not hesitate hurting you to get its way.$6",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.28": "...$s",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.29": "...$l#$b#%Oarfish vows to protect you.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.30": "Ehehe, this is awesome! It's gonna be like old times, eh Fish?$h",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.31": "...!$h#$b#...$u",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.32": "...?$7#$b#%Oarfish offers to warp you back home.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.33": "#Yes, please (warp back home).#No thanks.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.34": "...$l#$b#%Oarfish pats you on the shoulder.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.35": "See you around, @.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart6.36": "...I just hope it gets resolved soon.",


	// EVENT Oarfish 6 Hearts: Part 7: Stand-off CODE: 10312009
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.1": "Heh! Not so hot now, are ya?$12",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.2": "...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.3": "Hmm?#$b#Hehe, smells like you wouldn't be around for much longer.$11",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.4": "???: Admit it, it was funny.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.5": "???: So what if I'm wearing her skin?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.6": "???: She's a real troublemaker anyways. It doesn't make a difference if I go around spreading chaos with her looks.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.7": "...$a",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.8": "???: Ugh... stop it already.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.9": "???: And you call yourselves the good guys?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.10": "???: Oof!",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.11": "I can still smell your mouth flapping.$6#$b#Aren't you supposed to be... poofing right now?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.12": "???: I just wanted to have some fun.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.13": "???: But then here you are, beating me up over some childish pranks.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.14": "...!$a",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.15": "Yeah, they weren't just pranks.#$b#You could've blasted some people to bits.$6#$b#So, you absolutely deserve a beating~!$11",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.16": "C'mon, turn to your original form already.$6",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.17": "???: ...What's the point?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.18": "???: You're just gonna tear me apart...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.19": "...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.20": "???: I've changed my mind.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.21": "???: Heh, I'll never give you the satisfaction.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.22": "???: I don't care if you kill me. You both can go stick it where the sun don't shine!",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.23": "...$a",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.24": "Uh, Fish? I don't think-$8",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.25": "Eck. Bad timing, @.$6",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.26": "...!$u#$b#...$s",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.27": "???: H-hey... @.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.28": "???: Look at me.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.29": "Ermm... You shouldn't come any closer, @. She's pretty dangerous.$10",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.30": "???: Your \"friends\" did this to me.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.31": "...$a",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.32": "???: C'mon, @. Think about it.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.33": "???: I was just fooling around. Those bombs weren't even real.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.34": "???: I just wanted to scare and annoy people for fun. Believe me, some of them had it coming.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.35": "???: But this? @, your friends are brutal.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.36": "???: You shouldn't trust them after seeing this. You'd be crazy to still hang out with them. Who knows what they'll do to you?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.37": "You're real talkative for someone \"dying\".$6#$b#C'mon, we didn't even hit you that hard.$11",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.38": "???: You heard that?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.39": "???: @, if I were you, I'd turn around and run for it.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.40": "...$s",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.41": "...?$l",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.42": "...Fish?$10",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.43": "???: ...",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.44": "???: Gotcha.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.45": "???: ...You're all going with me.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.46": "Huh? What's going on?$8",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.47": "Umm... guys?$10",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.48": "(The mine's entrance has caved in.)",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.49": "Remi: You guys!",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.50": "Remi: I'll be fine!",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.51": "Remi: I can just claw my way out through this entrance.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.52": "...$l#$b#%Oarfish sighs in relief.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.53": "Remi: Can't sniff out where our little runt went to, though.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.54": "Remi: Either she's dead, or we lost her.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.55": "...$s",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.56": "Remi: We'll worry about that later.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.57": "Remi: Fish, take our friend somewhere safe for now.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.58": "Remi: I gotta stay here and clean up the place. 'Cause we're responsible like that, yeah?",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.59": "...!$h",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.60": "...$l#$b#%Oarfish seems relieved you're okay.",
	"oarfish.6HeartsPart7.61": "...We'll be fine, I think.",


	// EVENT Oarfish 8 Hearts: Calamari CODE: 10312013
	"oarfish.8Hearts.1": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish is happy you arrived.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.2": "$q 10313009 null#...#$r 10313009 0 Event_oarfish8Hearts1#So, what is it you need help for?",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.Answer1": "...!$h",
	//
	"oarfish.8Hearts.3": "...!$h#$b#%Oarfish caught a squid!",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.4": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish gestured you to follow her.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.5": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish got wheat flour and a bottle of oil in her hands.#$b#%She seems to be done shopping.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.6": "...$s",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.7": "...?$l#$b#%She hands you the groceries before discreetly pointing at Pierre's direction.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.8": "Oarfish gave you enough g to purchase the goods.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.9": "Hey, @. Is that all?#$b#Here you go. Thanks for stopping by!$1#$b#Oh, and don't forget to check our seasonal seeds for sale.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.10": "Huh?$6#$b#Oh, hey Fish. Of course it would be you.$11",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.11": "Can't forget @. So what do you need me for?",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.12": "Mmmm... smells good, doesn't it?$11",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.13": "...!$h",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.14": "What are you worried about?#$b#I'm sure the mayor wouldn't mind. You said he'd be out for another few hours, right?",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.15": "Then this is no issue. That fried calamari smell will be gone by then.$11",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.16": "...$s",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.17": "...?$l#$b#%Oarfish nudges the box of fried calamari towards your hands. It seems like she wants you to be the one to hand Pierre her gift.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.18": "#(Give the Fried Calamari to Pierre for Oarfish)#(Urge Oarfish to hand the gift to Pierre herself)",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.19": "...$s",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.20": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish nodded.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.21": "Oh, hello! I don't see you around often.#$b#Feel free to browse!$1",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.22": "Mmmm, something smells good!$1#$b#Huh? What's that you're giving me?$4",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.23": "Fried Calamari? For me?$4#$b#How did you know I love this? Thank you!$1",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.24": "Say, weren't you the one who walked by my shop not long ago?#$b#Sorry you had to see the mess.$2",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.25": "I still don't know who caused all that chaos around town, but lately it's been really peaceful.#$b#I guess they got caught!$1",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.26": "...",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.27": "...$7",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.28": "$q 10313010 null#...#$r 10313010 100 Event_oarfish8Hearts2#See? That wasn't so bad. You did well, Oarfish.#$r 10313011 100 Event_oarfish8Hearts3#Would've been funny if you threw it at his face...",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.Answer2": "...$l#$b#...!!$h#$b#%Oarfish is beaming.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.Answer3": "...$u#$b#...!!$h#$b#%Oarfish silently laughs at the thought.",
	//
	"oarfish.8Hearts.29": "Oarfish seems really happy, at least.",
	// fork oarfish8hearts_givecalamari
	"oarfish.8Hearts.30": "...!$h#$b#%You take the calamari from Oarfish's hands.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.31": "Oh, it's you again.#$b#Did you forget to buy something? Feel free to browse.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.32": "Mmmmm, something smells good!$1#$b#Hey, what's that you're carrying, @?",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.33": "#It's a gift for you.#(Throw the calamari at his face.)",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.34": "Gah!!!$2",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.35": "...!$u",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.36": "...!!!$h",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.37": "@!!!$3#$b#That better had been a dare!$3#$b#Do that again and you're banned for a month!$3",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.38": "*huff!*",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.39": "Well that was fun!",
	// fork2 oarfish8hearts_goodgiftcalamari
	"oarfish.8Hearts.40": "For me? I love Fried Calamari! Thank you, @!$1",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.41": "Huh? It's from someone else?#$b#Well then, let them know they made me really happy with this gift!$1",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.42": "Why can't they give it to me personally, though?#$b#Oh! They're shy?$4#$b#Aww, well I hope to meet them in person one day.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.43": "...!$h#$b#%Oarfish is grateful.",
	"oarfish.8Hearts.44": "Oarfish seems really happy today, at least.",


	// EVENT Oarfish 10 Hearts: Gift CODE: 10312016
	"oarfish.10Hearts.1": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish beckons you to stand next to her.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.2": "...$7",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.3": "...?$l",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.4": "...!$h#$b#%Oarfish pulled something from behind your ear.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.5": "It was a small oyster shell!",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.6": "...$7",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.7": "Oarfish opens the shell.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.8": "[797]...!$h#$b#%Oarfish hands you the pearl.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.9": "...$l#$b#%Oarfish insists you keep the gift.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.10": "%Holding both your hands, she clasped them closed around the pearl, like they were shells.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.11": "...$l",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.12": "It was an unusually uneventful day, sitting and chatting with Oarfish.",
	"oarfish.10Hearts.13": "But uneventful is also nice, especially with someone like Oarfish...",


	// EVENT Oarfish 14 Hearts: Beat'Em Up CODE: 10312017
	"oarfish.14Hearts.1": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish greets you good morning.",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.2": "???: Hey! You think you've seen the last of me?",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.3": "???: I'm gonna tear this door down and pull your insides out!",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.4": "...$a",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.5": "...$s",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.6": "...?$l#$b#%Oarfish asks if you would allow her to \"investigate\"...",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.7": "#Why not? Beat 'em up.#Okay, but not too much force.",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.8": "...!$h",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.9": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish gestures they wouldn't come back in a while.",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.10": "...!$h#$b#%She reassures you that you'll be safe from them.",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.11": "Never a dull moment with Oarfish...",
	// Beat 'em up!
	"oarfish.14Hearts.12": "...!$h",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.13": "...$7#$b#%Oarfish grins triumphantly.",
	"oarfish.14Hearts.14": "Never a dull moment with Oarfish!",


// ***** [MAIL] MAIL CONTENTS *****
	// General Gifts in MAIL
	"MAIL.General.Remi": "Hey, @!^^Fish helped me with writing this letter. I thought to send you something. Cheers!  ^^   -Remi %item object 303 1 459 1 %%[#]A Gift From Remi",
	"MAIL.General.Oarfish": "Dear @,^^I got this from the sea. Humans consider these treasures, but I have no use for Earthly riches. You can have it.^^   -Oarfish %item object 166 1 %%[#]A Gift From Oarfish",

	// Heart Events MAIL
	"MAIL.10HeartsLetter.Remi": "Hey, @!^^First, I'm super happy that we're best buds now. Second, if you got the time, could you visit me at the railroad?^As always, whatever day works. See ya.^^P.S. This is Oarfish's handwriting. Pretty, ain't it?^^   -Remi   [#]Remi's Note",

	"MAIL.6HeartsLetter.Oarfish": "To @,^^Remi and I found my double. The valley is safer now.^^   -Oarfish   [#]Oarfish - Double is caught",
	"MAIL.6HeartsLetterRemi.Oarfish": "Hey @!^^We work fast, don't we? Well, we could've worked faster and prevented more damage over at Pelican Town, but we try not to get too involved in human affairs until it's actually something supernatural and dangerous.^^We were too late to realize that. Sorry.^^^But anyways, you ought to know that Oarfish is our main officer back home. She and I are partners in crime, as well as partners in dealing with crime. Hehe.^^We're pretty good at our jobs, but this planet got different rules, you know? We can't just take matters into our own hands willy-nilly.^^Cave is all fixed up. Everything should be in order. Alright, take care!^^   -Remi   [#]Remi - Double is caught",

	"MAIL.8HeartsLetter.Oarfish": "Dear @,^^I need your assistance. When you have time, come see me at the beach on a sunny day.^^   -Oarfish   [#]Oarfish - Need Assistance",
	"MAIL.8HeartsLetterAfterEvent.Oarfish": "To @,^^Thank you for assisting me. I thoroughly enjoyed the process of preparing gifts for others, so yesterday was well spent.^^I'll be checking the town calendar frequently now. Feel free to come along with me when you have the time again.^^^Actually, I might need your assistance every now and then. I'm sorry to say I'm still not confident enough. Anyhow, cheers.^^   -Oarfish   [#]Oarfish - Thank you",

	"MAIL.10HeartsLetter.Oarfish": "To @,^^I'm happy we have become very close friends.^^However, while I have been preparing gifts the townspeople would love for their birthdays, yours is not on the calendar. If you have the time to chat, please come meet me at the beach. I would love to know more about you.^^   -Oarfish   [#]Oarfish - Invitation",


// ***** [DIAL] GENERAL DIALOGUE *****
// Remi Regular Dialogue
	"DIALOGUE.remi.Introduction": "You can see me?#$b#That's weird...",


// Remi 0 Hearts Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Spring Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.monday.a": "This season smells... pink. Yeah.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.monday.b": "Smells refreshing, don't you think so too?$9 #$e#The season, I mean. Spring, right?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.tuesday.a": "Don't you just love that nice spring air?$11 #$b#Feels like a brand new start.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.tuesday.b": "Good to see you again. Everything smells fresh, eh?$9 #$e#See you later.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.wednesday.a": "Up and at 'em, eh?$11 #$e#Have a good one.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.wednesday.b": "Heya. #$e#Yeah, I got nothing. Sorry.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.thursday.a": "Hmm... what to do... $11 #$e#Any ideas?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.thursday.b": "*yaaaawn*, I think I'm gonna take a nap. #$e#...zzzZZzzz... $u",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.friday.a": "Tonight will be fun. #$e#You know why.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.friday.b": "%Remi cracked her knuckles. #$b#Alright, I'm all geared up.$11 #$e#Oh, hey.#$b#It's always good to be prepared, no?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.saturday.a": "Hi there. #$e#Hm, me? Yesterday's good.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.saturday.b": "Tomorrow's another lazy day.$11 #$e#Do you take breaks, farmer?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.sunday.a": "*Yaaawn*... $u #$e#I still feel sleepy...$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.spring.sunday.b": "I'll be here the whole day. #$e#Fish will be at the beach the whole day, too.",

	// Summer Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.monday.a": "It's you again. $9#$b#...$6 #$b#Oh, sorry. I can't sense the passing of time, so I can't tell when was the last time you've been here. #$b#Just so you know.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.monday.b": "...Hmm?$6 #$b#Oh, hi there.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.tuesday.a": "Have I told you that I'm blind and deaf? #$b#Well, that and I also have poor memory. So, excuse me if I repeat myself.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.tuesday.b": "Oh, hi. #$e#Your name's... #$b#Err, have you actually told me your name?$6 #$e#Maybe I forgot. Sorry about that.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.wednesday.a": "Hi, farmer. #$e#You smell earthy. It's nice.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.wednesday.b": "You moved here not too long ago? Neat.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.thursday.a": "My friend is at the beach. Have you met her? #$b#Don't hit on her though, she's taken. Hehe.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.thursday.b": "Oh, it's you again. #$e#...Hm? Got any questions for me?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.friday.a": "Hello. #$e#Having fun?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.friday.b": "Heya. #$b#By the way, thanks for finding me out here.$11 #$b#Huh? Have I told you that already?$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.saturday.a": "Hi.#$b#...#$b#Sorry. Lazy mood.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.saturday.b": "This season's making me want ice cream.$11 #$e#Hm? Need something?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.sunday.a": "How long has it been? #$b#A week? Gee, time sure flies. #$e#Not that I can tell.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.summer.sunday.b": "Smells like you've been busy the whole week. #$e#It's not a bad smell.",

	// Fall Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.monday.a": "Eheheheee... $u #$e#Oh hey, sorry. Just in a really good mood.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.monday.b": "Smells crunchy, huh? #$e#The season, I mean. Fall, is it?$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.tuesday.a": "You doing good? #$e#I'm okay.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.tuesday.b": "Kinda hungry... $6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.wednesday.a": "Taking a break? #$e#Why do you come up to the railroad anyways, if you don't mind me asking?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.wednesday.b": "Heya, just stretching my legs a bit.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.thursday.a": "You speaking to Fish much? #$b#She's a good friend of mine, so treat her good.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.thursday.b": "Oh hi. #$e#I'm not doing anything today.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.friday.a": "Smells like a good day. #$e#Sigh, this season's making me sleepy...$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.friday.b": "Why am I geared up, you ask? #$b#I'm going to the mines. Just something Fish and I do.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.saturday.a": "I hope you don't mind another alcoholic in town. #$e#Sorry, weird way to start.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.saturday.b": "Smells spooky. I wonder what they're up to...",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.sunday.a": "How's business? Good?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.fall.sunday.b": "Smells like good harvest.$11 #$e#You're a farmer, right? Good work.",

	// Winter Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.monday.a": "Good to see you. #$b#Farm doing good?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.monday.b": "Smells... frosty. Yup",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.tuesday.a": "Hello there. #$e#Stay warm, okay?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.tuesday.b": "Yo. #$e#I could go for some hot porridge right about now...$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.wednesday.a": "%Remi seems frozen. #$e#%*Snap!*. #$b#Buh!$8 #$b#Sorry, I forgot to keep my body moving. I was just frozen there, huh?$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.wednesday.b": "I should really find a different spot to hang around in during this cold season...$6 #$e#...but I don't wanna move either. Ughh...$7",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.thursday.a": "So, how's Fish been treating you? #$b#I hope you two are getting along.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.thursday.b": "Brr... cold.$6 #$e#You're not freezing or anything?$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.friday.a": "Do you mine much? #$e#The underground's more comfy this season, I feel.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.friday.b": "No frostbites so far? That's good. #$e#Keep safe out there.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.saturday.a": "You're free to hang out with us, you know? #$e#Oh, you already know? Okay.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.saturday.b": "Saloon night!$h #$b#Huh? Saloon night was yesterday?$6 #$e#If you say so.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.sunday.a": "Pretty chill week, huh? #$e#I meant what I said.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.0.winter.sunday.b": "What a week, eh? #$e#I'm starting to miss Spring, actually.$6",


// Remi 2 Hearts Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Spring Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.monday.a": "This season's nice, too. Smells pink and flowery all around...$11 #$e#What's your favorite season, @?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.monday.b": "You again, it's good to see you.$9 #$e#I'm visiting Fish later. Same spot as always.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.tuesday.a": "Do you eat at the saloon sometimes, @? #$b#Just thinking maybe you can recommend me something from Gus' menu.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.tuesday.b": "Hey @.#$e#Did I say your name right? #$e#I can't hear myself talk, so...$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.wednesday.a": "Wednesday... Wensday... Wed-nes... day.$6#$b#Oh sorry, I almost didn't smell you there.$11#$e#It's Wednesday, right? So how's your Wednesday?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.wednesday.b": "Another fresh day.$11 #$b#I'm in the mood for foraging all of a sudden.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.thursday.a": "Fish has been telling me stuff about you.$9 #$e#You're quite the character, she told me. #$e#I meant that in a positive way.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.thursday.b": "The railroad's my favorite spot. #$e#It's where I landed face first, so it left an impression on me.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.friday.a": "I don't really feel like going underground when the air smells so fresh like this.$11 #$b#But a routine is a routine.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.friday.b": "Hey @. #$e# Just thinking about skipping town, explore other places... #$e#Nah.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.saturday.a": "You frequent the saloon much? Maybe you'll catch us there tonight. #$e#See you then.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.saturday.b": "Tomorrow's... Sunday, right? #$b#Good, that lines up the whole week for me, thanks.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.sunday.a": "Hey there. #$e#Has the week been good for you? #$e#Alright, take care.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.spring.sunday.b": "You here to tell me something? I'll listen. #$e#Of course I can use that word.$11",

	// Summer Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.monday.a": "Geez, it's hot. Maybe if I shed my coat...$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.monday.b": "Yesterday's Sunday, right. #$b#Awesome, I'm on track, then.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.tuesday.a": "I can't sense time. But that just means I use other sensations to tell whether it's night or day. #$e#Temperature is easy. Day of the week is a bit challenging if I don't know when Sunday is. #$e#Speaking of which, it's Tuesday, right?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.tuesday.b": "I hope no one's using the private dining table today...$6 #$e#Unless you're the one making reservations, then it's fine with me.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.wednesday.a": "Heyo! Oddly enough you don't smell as terrible as most humans.$9 #$e#You smell more like... the earth. Yeah.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.wednesday.b": "Hmm... maybe if I get Fish to stand behind the...$6 #$e#Oh, hi there. How's the farming going for ya?$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.thursday.a": "Thanks for visiting me again. I'll admit, it gets lonely after a few thousand sensations.$9 #$e#I can't sense time, so...",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.thursday.b": "Have you been spending time with Fish lately? #$e#She thinks you're pretty neat.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.friday.a": "Oops!$10 #$b#Sorry, my gear almost landed on you.$6 #$b#You okay?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.friday.b": "Maybe I'll escape the heat if I go underground... #$e#@, hey. You in the mood to mine?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.saturday.a": "A lot of people went to the saloon yesterday. There's no way I'm going on Fridays...$6 #$e#Ehh, I just don't like crowded places.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.saturday.b": "You got oranges on your farm? #$b#Oranges smell great. Taste good, too.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.sunday.a": "The earth shifted again. Everything smells new.$11 #$e#What do I mean? Well, for some reason a lot of changes happen whenever Sunday rolls around.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.summer.sunday.b": "The hot thing above us is called the sun, right? #$e#Just wondering why it's called differently.",

	// Fall Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.monday.a": "Nice to see you again. #$e#Of course I can use that word.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.monday.b": "Yup, I am forgotten in an instant someone looks away from my face.$11 #$e#Most don't even see me at all, even if do silly dances in front of people. #$e#You're a special case, though. I wonder what makes you different from the rest...$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.tuesday.a": "Sooo, are you good with other humans? #$e#Just small talk. #$e#Same species doesn't necessarily mean they treat each other well, so...$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.tuesday.b": "...kinda hungry.$6 #$e#Actually, we don't really starve. It's just me in a mood to eat stuff. #$e#Not everyone enjoys eating, though. Others can't do it at all. $6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.wednesday.a": "I love this season the most. Don't you, too?$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.wednesday.b": "What's up?$9 #$e#Oh, I'm shaky aren't I? Sorry, just kinda looking forward for something today.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.thursday.a": "Somedays, I'm just too lazy to do anything. You ever felt like that before?$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.thursday.b": "I wonder how Fish is doing.$6 #$b#Did you visit her today, by any chance?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.friday.a": "I can just smell that festive spirit not too far from here...$11 #$b#Oh hi. You feeling it too, right?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.friday.b": "I'll be in the mines today. Just the usual stuff.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.saturday.a": "Hi. Having a good day?#$e#Kinda hungry. Smells like good harvest.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.saturday.b": "You forage much? It's one of the things I love to do. #$e#Today would be a good day to pick up everything you find, though. #$b#Who knows what happens to them tomorrow...",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.sunday.a": "Hey, @. Glad you're here. #$e#I enjoy your company.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.fall.sunday.b": "You smell extra crunchy. It's a nice scent.",

	// Winter Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.monday.a": "Heya, good to see you.$9#$b#Farm doing good? #$e#Sooo, what do you do when everything's frozen?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.monday.b": "Aaa...$8 #$b#%AA-CHOOO! #$e#*sniffle*, sorry about that.$6 #$e#You doing okay in this cold?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.tuesday.a": "I wonder what Gus is cooking tonight. Something warm I hope. #$e#Great, now I'm hungry.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.tuesday.b": "Say, you got a nemesis in town or two? #$e#Sorry. None of my business, eh?$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.wednesday.a": "Ugh... the pond's gonna hurt my face tonight. $7 #$e#...$6 #$e#Oh, @. Sorry, didn't notice you immediately.$10",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.wednesday.b": "I'm bored.$6 #$e#You got questions for me? Go on, shoot. #$e#Ermm, that's kinda complicated...$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.thursday.a": "The bathhouse? No thanks. #$e#The place reeks.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.thursday.b": "What if I just try sleeping until Spring comes around...$6 #$e#Nah. I might sleep forever.$6 #$e#Hey, @. Yeah, I talk to myself a lot.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.friday.a": "Maybe if I dig a hole in the ground...$6 #$e#Nah. Wouldn't make a difference.$6 #$e#Oh, hey @. Just musing to myself.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.friday.b": "Say, @. What do you do on a day like this? #$e#Sorry, none of my business. Hehe.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.saturday.a": "I'm digging a lot of yummy stuff from the ground this season.$9 #$b#Yeah, the snow yams are pretty good. Once you're past the initial brain freeze, that is.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.saturday.b": "Fish and I will be at the Saloon later tonight. Are you free? #$e#M'kay, later.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.sunday.a": "Brr.... $6#$b#Aren't you cold out here?$6 #$e#Well, do whatever you want. Just stay in good health, okay?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.2.winter.sunday.b": "How's your week been? Productive? Took it easy? #$e#Either way is good. You deserve a break.$11",


// Remi 4 Hearts Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Spring Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.monday.a": "Winter break's over, and all I hear are the desires of man to curse Monday to the depths of hades.$11 #$b#Simply put, another wonderful start of a new week.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.monday.b": "With all the flowers blooming, the surface smells good whenever I get to take a walk around the valley.$11 #$b#Until I reach Pelican Town, then I hold my breath.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.tuesday.a": "Good day, ain't it? #$e#Hmm, topic, topic... ehhh...$6 #$b#Sorry, I got nothing today.$11 #$b#It's nice of you to see me, though.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.tuesday.b": "If you got any questions, feel free to ask. #$e#...are you even capable of asking questions?$6 #$b#Well, whatever. You'll get to know me a little better each time you see me.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.wednesday.a": "My eyes are in two different colors? I didn't know that.$6#$e#Are eyes supposed to look the same?#$b#Well, I figured most bodies of living beings are symmetrical, so that makes sense.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.wednesday.b": "Evening flowers are going to smell so good tonight.$11 #$b#Well hey, that's actually another good way to tell the time.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.thursday.a": "Do you prefer shopping for ingredients, or do you make all of them out of your own produce? #$e#I still can't figure out vinegar. Can't be completely self-sustainable in this town.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.thursday.b": "Has Fish ever been mean to you, @? #$b#I hope you forgive her if she ever upsets you. She's still learning how humans work. #$e#Trust me when I say her intentions were always to make her new friend happy. I know her desires, too.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.friday.a": "Do you smell that?#$b#Smells like... %favorite.#$e#What? Isn't that what you desire most?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.friday.b": "None of the minerals underground is alive, just letting you know. #$e#Oh, you already know? Okay.$6 #$e#Yup, everything's peachy.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.saturday.a": "Tonight's saloon night. Join us if you want. I'll even get you something from the menu.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.saturday.b": "If any sort of event is going on in town, you bet we're not going.$11 #$e#You know the drill. I hate the smell, and Fish is super shy.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.sunday.a": "Do you fish much? It's one of the hobbies I share with Oarfish. #$e#If you got any spare fishies lying around, I can make a mean sashimi with it.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.spring.sunday.b": "Hey there, buddy. How've you been this whole week?$9 #$e#...eh, sounds unnatural. I'll tone it down a bit.$6",

	// Summer Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.monday.a": "Is it... Sunday?$6#$b#No- Monday. It's Monday.$10#$e#Sorry if I threw you off. I know how important time is to you.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.monday.b": "Hoo boy, it just gets hotter and hotter every week.$11 #$b#You better stay hydrated, @.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.tuesday.a": "Hmm, I wonder if Gus also serves tropical banana shakes...$11 #$b#Huh? He doesn't sell that here? Bummer.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.tuesday.b": "Oarfish always got something in her sketchbook. Have you taken a peek yet? #$e#I don't see 'em, but she sometimes make them textured for me specifically.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.wednesday.a": "*Yaaaaawn*...$u #$b#A little siesta couldn't hurt. How are you coping in this heat, @? #$e#Hmmkay, see ya. I'll be under a shade.$11 #$e#...zzzzZZZZzzzZZzzz...$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.wednesday.b": "... *mumble* *mumble* ... $7#$b#...hope she doesn't push me today.$7 #$b#Oh, @. Didn't smell you there.$9 #$e#Hm? Oh it's nothing to worry about.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.thursday.a": "And we meet again. #$b#I don't mind your company at all. Come see me whenever you like.$9 #$e#T'was nice talking with you.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.thursday.b": "Sometimes, the train passes by and I can smell an entire cargo of oranges. #$b#I got several oranges out of that.$11 #$e#What do you mean there's no such orange cargo?$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.friday.a": "Smells like everyone's favorite day of the week.$11#$b#What do you do on a day like this?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.friday.b": "I don't like the ocean. Scares me.$6 #$e#I do like fishing with Fish, though. Kind of ironic but it happens.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.saturday.a": "I dug up way too many cave carrots yesterday.$6 #$e#Say, do you think it's good business to sell Miner's Treat close by the Adventurer's Guild? #$b#You just gotta supply me the milk and sugar and I'll handle the mass production.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.saturday.b": "The ocean smells a certain way this season. It's making me nervous.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.sunday.a": "Haaah, what a drag.$7 #$e#Just when will this Summer end?$6 #$e#I should really get rid of this coat but... I can't.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.summer.sunday.b": "You okay, @? You smell kinda toasty.$6 #$e#Go under a shade and rest maybe? I'm worried about you.$6 #$e#You're fine? Well, if you say so.",

	// Fall Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.monday.a": "It's getting a bit chillier than usual.$11 #$b#And of course, good to see you again, @.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.monday.b": "Crunch, crunch, crunch. Smells like a good day to visit Fish.$11 #$e#Oh, and it's nice of you to visit me, @.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.tuesday.a": "Things smell really ripe, fruits taste extra sweet...$11 #$b#Haah, this season's the best.$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.tuesday.b": "Today's Tasty Tuesday... that means a new dish at the saloon to try.$11 #$e#You know, I'm a pretty mean cook myself. I should get you to try my recipes sometime.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.wednesday.a": "Is the shop open today? You know the one. #$e#Not plotting anything, nope. Just thinking about sourcing some ingredients the legal way.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.wednesday.b": "The pond smells magical at nighttime this season, I'm looking forward to it.$11 #$b#Have you ever just stood and admired your surroundings, @? #$e#Yeah, I get that you're usually too busy for that. Do take breaks sometimes, though.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.thursday.a": "Hey, I hope you don't mind me asking questions about you. #$b#With that said, you can ask me questions, too.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.thursday.b": "...$9 #$e#Hmm? Ah, I'm just happy for no reason. Is it strange?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.friday.a": "...zzzzZZzZZzzzz...$u #$e#AAA-$13 #$b#aaa...$8 #$e#That was a nightmare, I think. Can't remember what it was about, though.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.friday.b": "I got this feeling that the monsters are afraid of humans more than humans being afraid of them. #$e#It's something about this season, I tell you.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.saturday.a": "The mine was something else yesterday, let me tell you.$11 #$e#See, there were some skeletons crying about their lost loved ones and... $9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.saturday.b": "Don't you just love it when you get better at the things you do? Feels rewarding when that happens.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.sunday.a": "It's Sunday today, right? #$b#Thanks, I got something I need to do a couple days later otherwise Fish gets mad at me.$11 #$e#Oh? It's nothing important. Small projects and stuff.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.fall.sunday.b": "I just want to sit here and do nothing.$11 #$e#You with me, @? No? #$b#Okay then. Have a good day.$11",

	// Winter Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.monday.a": "Aa-$8 #$b#%Remi sneezed in her sleeve. #$b#Hoo- gosh, almost splattered all over you there. Sorry.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.monday.b": "Everything feels slower now that the world feels so cold. #$e#It's basic thermodynamics. Applies to where I came from, too. #$e#Slow? Fast? I can only tell as much from the changes in my senses taking a thousand more or less instances than usual. #$b#Okay, enough nerd talk from me. How've you been?$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.tuesday.a": "I know I said I can sense your desires, but that doesn't mean I can make sense of all of them.$6 #$b#With that said, what are your most loved gifts?$9 #$e#What? That's cheating? Boooo.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.tuesday.b": "Hmmm, something warm, something tasty, something like a hug in the shape of a bowl...$11 #$e#Gus. Gus is always the answer.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.wednesday.a": "I hope the pond freezes over...$6 #$b#Huh? Hey, @. Here to chat? #$e#I'll right, see ya.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.wednesday.b": "I think it's neat that the valley's waters never freeze enough where you can't fish anymore. #$b#Sashimi all year 'round.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.thursday.a": "Snow ball fight?$6 #$b#I can't aim, though.$6 #$e#Ehh, why not. Go on, throw snow at me. About time I flex my evasion skills on you.$11 #$e#%Remi got hit on the first snowball.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.thursday.b": "Fish is about as cold as this winter season when you don't know her. #$e#She tried to drown me in the ocean when we first met.$6 #$e#Lucky you, eh?$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.friday.a": "Hey @. I'm just prepping up for later. #$e#Winter is the best season to waste the whole day in the mines, I think. It isn't as chilly underground.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.friday.b": "Tomorrow's Sunday, right? #$b#Oh wait, no. It's Saturday tomorrow.$10 #$e#Almost ruined my entire schedule there. Fish would be upset.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.saturday.a": "Do you play games, @? I think Fish is interested to know what genre you're into. #$e#She's just too shy to ask directly.$11 #$b#Give her time and she'll get comfy to ya soon enough.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.saturday.b": "Feels like a good day to end the night with beer.$u #$e#*sluurp* Sorry, just can't help it.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.sunday.a": "I wish you all the %favorite in the world.$11 #$e#...What? #$e#I can sense your desires, remember? Hehehe.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.4.winter.sunday.b": "Good to see you, buddy. $9#$e#You stay healthy now, y'hear? You're a rare one.",


// Remi 6 Hearts Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Spring Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.monday.a": "Ahh, nice fresh air.$u #$e#Hey, @. How about you stop and breathe for a bit? #$b#Inhale that fresh, country air.$11 #$e#That was nice, wasn't it? Now off you go.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.monday.b": "Hey there. Take it easy. #$e#Hmm, still here? Okay. I have a question for you.$9 #$b#Are you the type who eases into waking up, savoring the comfort of your mattress, or the type who literally springs off the bed the moment you're conscious?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.tuesday.a": "This valley is so bountiful that even a lost human being with no survival skills wouldn't die from starvation here.$11 #$b#With hands like yours, though... you can so easily revitalize and destroy this valley in just a short span of 'time'.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.tuesday.b": "Gus' cooking just keeps getting better and better.$11 #$e#He doesn't remember me, but I can't possibly forget such talent.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.wednesday.a": "I never failed to stop walking right when I reach the very edge of the wooden docks. It's talent, I tell ya.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.wednesday.b": "Hey, @. If you got free time tonight, why don't we relax by the pond in Cindersap Forest? #$b#The evening flowers smell really lovely.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.thursday.a": "Hey @. #$e#Hm? Topic, topic, err..... Oh yeah. #$b#Don't give Fish any sort of vegetable. She hates those.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.thursday.b": "Yeah, I get Fish to write for me from time to time. #$e#I could write to you in braille but I'm lazy. #$e#Besides, you get to enjoy Fish's handwriting. At least, I assume it's pretty.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.friday.a": "Sorry if this is a stupid question but...$6#$b#is %favorite something you can eat in this planet?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.friday.b": "I don't go in the mines alone. I mean, I'll be fine down there by myself. #$b#But the underground doesn't change enough to tell me whether a day has passed, you get me?$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.saturday.a": "Don't you want to take it easy sometimes? I know winter just ended but it ain't harvest moon yet, y'know? #$b#Ahh, well, I ain't stopping you either way. Do what you need to do, @.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.saturday.b": "Warp totems, eh? Pretty handy mode of transport if you ask me. #$b#But it can't take you 'everywhere'. If there's a faraway place in this planet you want to go to, I'll warp you there in a snap.$11 #$e#...if you're dreaming, that is.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.sunday.a": "Another week has passed, huh?#$b#Heh, I think I'm getting better at it.$11#$e#Earth is a huge ball of randomness, but also manmade and naturally occurring patterns... I think.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.spring.sunday.b": "I'm free the whole day. Want to take me along with you? #$e#I'm pretty handy, you know? By the end of the day, I already have filled your pockets with stuff lying around on the ground.$9",

	// Summer Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.monday.a": "Hey @. Hot day, eh? #$e#You know, I've been thinking. An orange juice stand would introduce competition to the ice cream stand market in town.$11 #$e#How 'bout you and I become business partners?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.monday.b": "@, good to see you. How are you coping in this heat? #$e#If it gets too hot, I can always take you to space, ehehe!$h",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.tuesday.a": "So, have you been making crab sticks with the recipe I sent you by any chance? #$b#Real, authentic crab sticks made from actual crab meat. You don't get those just anywhere for cheap, you know?$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.tuesday.b": "Tuesday right? #$b#Okay, good. Today's the day I enhance my tastebuds.$11 #$e#Heh, this time, I'll learn that special recipe Gus is so secretive about...$12",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.wednesday.a": "Should be breezy later, yeah. #$b#Say, @. You ever admired the moon's reflection on the surface of the pond? #$e#Me neither. But you know, if you stare at the moon for too long you might go insane so, be careful.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.wednesday.b": "Hey @, good to see you. #$b#You smell like you've been working non-stop. Or maybe it's just the summer heat making you sweatier than usual. #$e#Don't forget to drink water, @. That's an order.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.thursday.a": "I wonder if the library has books in braille...$6 #$b#Might be a good way to pass the time rather than be in this Summer heat.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.thursday.b": "...$8 #$b#Huh? Oh, sorry. I was blanking out, wasn't I.$6 #$e#The ocean... is just something else this season. I can't help but feel something strange and ominous about it.$s",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.friday.a": "It gets hotter the deeper we go underground...$6 #$e#Maybe we shouldn't go too deep this time.$6 #$e#Huh? An endless cavern with a constant temperature? #$b#Sounds good to me. Where is this cavern you speak of?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.friday.b": "I don't hate humanity or anything. I just can't stand their odor for too long.$7 #$e#And that's why we avoid the saloon on Fridays.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.saturday.a": "Saturdays are the best for all three of us to hang out at the Saloon. So, if you can make it during the evening, we'll have a great time.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.saturday.b": "Yeah, Fish can walk on water. #$b#I can't.$6 #$e#It's exclusive to her subtype of our, err... species. All of them can walk on water. #$e#I even know some other subtype that can control massive bodies of water and drown the entire planet. Now that's terrifying...$11 #$e#...like really, really terrifying.$8",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.sunday.a": "Having a good weekend, @? #$e#I got nothing much to say today, but I am glad you came to see me.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.summer.sunday.b": "...*drooool*...$u #$b#Oh, hey @. Sorry. I'm just thinking about tempura. I'm already missing that good crunch.$11 #$e#Say, how about a seafood boil party? Fish would love it.$9",

	// Fall Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.monday.a": "Today is Monday, so... alright, I got the whole week sorted out.$11 #$e#Of course, my schedule got room for you too, @.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.monday.b": "Aah, the smell of dried leaves and hazelnuts. What a time to be alive.$u #$e#Ehehee, sorry. Can't help myself when everything smells so crunchy and tasty.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.tuesday.a": "You know, as much as we love the buffs that come with crab cakes and lucky lunches, don't you ever get tired of only eating the same foods?$6 #$b#Don't you ever crave for something different? Like Cranberry Sauce?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.tuesday.b": "Fish and I will eat at the saloon.#$b#See us this evening if you can. We'll get a third seat for you.$11#$e#On that note, what's your favorite meal?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.wednesday.a": "*sigh*... I really don't want to sleep with the fishes tonight.$7 #$e#Say, @... are you busy later?$9 #$b#Well, I uhh, just kinda want you to check on Fish, see if she'll do something mean, you know?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.wednesday.b": "I know it's strange. Fish bullies me a lot.$6 #$b#But her underlying desires tell me they're mostly out of love. #$b#Mostly.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.thursday.a": "Hey, @. I really appreciate you coming to see me here.$9 #$e#I dunno, something about Autumn is making me more emotional than usual.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.thursday.b": "The animals smell hectic this season. They desire nothing but food and a place to sleep. #$e#Human desires are a lot more complex than that but they all still boil down to making sure they meet their physiological necessities. #$b#That's how you know something is living.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.friday.a": "The monsters were panicking more than usual in the mines last time we were there.$6 #$e#Something about this season is making them anxious.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.friday.b": "Oarfish and I love this season. Probably for different reasons, though. #$e#For me, this season smells crunchy and ripe. As for Oarfish... #$b#Maybe you go find out yourself? You can ask her stuff.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.saturday.a": "Spirits? Ghosts? While they are most of the time incorporeal, Fish and I are made of the same material that makes them untouchable if not for the mass our bodies artificially create so we can properly interact with the world. #$e#Whoops, there I am again with useless trivia about our species.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.saturday.b": "I'm not into that trash cola. Even I have standards.$6 #$b#You can give those to Fish, though. She loves those sugar bombs.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.sunday.a": "It's Sunday, right? #$b#Great.$9 #$e#...Hm? Why should I explain anything? It's none of your business.$6 #$b#Pfft- ahahaha! Just kidding!$h #$b#Yeah, I got nothing planned. But I still wanna know if I'm on track with my weekends. Thanks for always confirming for me, @.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.fall.sunday.b": "Things are slowing down a bit, aging and resting under bundles of warmth. It's making me sleepy.$11 #$e#Honestly, I don't know what I am saying sometimes. Words just flow according to what I feel at the moment. #$b#I think it's nice to let your mind loose and say whatever you want every once in a while. It's relaxing.$9",

	// Winter Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.monday.a": "Aah-$8 #$b#AAAHH-$13 #$b#%... #$b#Hah, didn't sneeze this time.$11 #$e#%AA-CHOOO! #$b#*sniffle*... $6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.monday.b": "You wearing something thicker than usual, @? I don't want you to get sick- #$b#AA-$13 #$b#%AA-CHOOO!!",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.tuesday.a": "Ahaha, yeah. Gus is my other favorite human.$h #$b#He smells more like the food he makes, and that makes him a lot more bearable to me. #$e#Too bad he can't remember me. Would be nice to learn directly from him.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.tuesday.b": "Now that I thought of it, you haven't seen what my hands look like, right? #$b#Well, you're not gonna see them now since it's so freakin' col-$8 #$b#AA-$13 #$b#%-CHOOO!!",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.wednesday.a": "Whether the waters freeze over or not, it's still gonna be bad news for me...$7 #$e#Ah, I shouldn't be saying that. The fact that the ocean, rivers and ponds aren't frozen means that you can still fish, and that's good, right?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.wednesday.b": "Right, time to stretch my legs. #$e#... #$b#Huh? Why am I not stretching? Is it that time already?$6 #$e#Pretty sure it takes me about an average of 670 instances after I said I'll stretch my legs, and then I actually stretch my legs.$6 #$b#Man, winter is so slow...$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.thursday.a": "Is it working? Do you like me a little better each time we talk and give each other gifts? #$e#I mean, there's little changes each time we meet, for the better of course.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.thursday.b": "The world is asleep, and every breathing being dreams of the fresh breeze of Spring.$11 #$e#Hiberating sounds like a good idea, until I remember I gotta keep Fish entertained somehow. #$e#Well, it's more complicated than that, but I don't feel like elaborating right now. It's a long story.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.friday.a": "Fridays are the only days Fish visits me at the Railroad. #$b#It's closer to the mines, and we always go in together. #$e#She's quite fussy about my gear, but that just means we're always good to go.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.friday.b": "Hey uh, be careful when you're in the mines, alright? #$b#I'll be frank, I don't want you to die too soon.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.saturday.a": "%Remi froze solid right in front of you. #$b#%*SNAP!* #$b#GWAAH-!$13 #$b#Geez, I just can't let my guard down. It may not look like it, but keeping a constant temperature is a lot of conscious work for me.$6 #$b#I don't know how Fish does it so effortlessly...$7",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.saturday.b": "Hey @, if you're down, let's warm up at the saloon later tonight.$9 #$b#AA-$8 #$b#%AA-CHOOO!! #$e#*sniffle* ehehehe, sorry about that. How about some hot pasta later, yeah?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.sunday.a": "Gosh, when will this cold end?$7 #$e#Say, @. If it gets too cold around here, I can take you the sun to warm you up, ahahaha!$h",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.6.winter.sunday.b": "We're almost there, @. The next cycle will come soon. #$e#How soon exactly? I'm not sure.$11 #$b#All I know is that it's Sunday today, so I got a 1 out of 4 chance to be correct, right?",


// Remi 8 Hearts Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
	// Spring Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.monday.a": "A lot of things smell so new and fresh this season.$9 #$b#Like the wonderful scent of life springing out of the ground after being trapped under the cold for so long.$11 #$e#Huh, is that exactly what's happening?$10 #$b#Hm! Must be a beautiful thing to witness, then.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.monday.b": "Monday, Monday... moon's day...$11 #$e#Speaking of the moon, humans have landed on the surface before, right? #$b#Is it true as they say that there are rabbits on the moon?$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.tuesday.a": "Can't believe I'm saying this, but I love this planet.$11#$b#Getting past the smell, there's lots of fun to be had here. #$e#...hehehe, mommy was right.$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.tuesday.b": "This seasons's really nice for a picnic, eh? With this fresh breeze and the smell of flowers all over the valley...$11 #$e#Too bad we already got plans for tonight. You know where to find us, @.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.wednesday.a": "...$8 #$e#Huh? Uh, sorry. Was I spacing out?$6 #$b#I'm just a little nervous. Wednesday nights are Fish's favorite time to... you know.$7",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.wednesday.b": "I just love Spring flowers the most. Something about them being comparatively softer and bouncier than flowers of other seasons...$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.thursday.a": "I just can't dance. No sense of time means no sense of rhythm.$6 #$e#Fish is really good, though. She's literally made to dance for royalty.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.thursday.b": "...zzzZZzzZZzz...$u #$b#Hm? Oh, @. #$b#%Remi pulls you into a hug. #$b#.........$11 #$b#Hm? Let you go? No way. #$b#.........$11 #$b#.................$11 #$b#'kay fine. I'm letting you go now. Have a good one, @.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.friday.a": "There's surprisingly lots of vegetation deep underground. Have you seen it before? #$e#This valley is crazy bountiful, even the underground is habitable if you know how to do it.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.friday.b": "... *drool* ...$u #$b#Oh, hey *sluuurp*. Sorry. Was just thinking about my mom. #$e#What's with that sudden desire to run away?$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.saturday.a": "Arcade night!$9 #$b#Not that I can play any of the games, but just listening to Oarfish's turbulent desires is plenty entertaining enough for me. #$e#So, think you can beat Fish's high score?$12",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.saturday.b": "Ehehehe, if you ever reeled in a Joja Cola right out of the ocean, give it to Fish.$11 #$b#I'm sure she'll appreciate the extra salty taste.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.sunday.a": "Aaand it's Sunday. I'm sure of it.$11 #$e#Some flowers only bloom after the harshest of winters. I'm not sure if that flower exists in this valley. #$e#Welp, that's enough flower talk. I just like flowers in general.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.spring.sunday.b": "I'm free the whole day. So if you want to go on a stroll, how about inviting me? #$e#Ehehehe, I'm just looking for things to do. I literally got nothing going on today.$9",

	// Summer Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.monday.a": "Summer's a drag. Sorry to say.$6 #$e#Haahh, I finally said it. I hate summerrr...!$13",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.monday.b": "Just sitting and talking with Fish at the beach... enjoying her lovely company...$11 #$b# ... very close to the threatening smell of the ocean... very close to the threat of Fish herself...$6 #$b#...$6 #$e#I love her. I honestly do.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.tuesday.a": "How does one even sleep soundly in this heat? I've heard of siestas but this sun is ridiculous.$6 #$e#...zzzzZZZzzZzzz...$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.tuesday.b": "How's the space garden? You growing anything good in there? #$e#Amazing, ain't it? For as long as you will it, the garden shapes itself into a form you desire.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.wednesday.a": "Fish told me about wind chimes. Do you know about them, @? #$e#They're said to make noise that can make you feel cooler in this summer heat. #$b#It's just that... how does that work? The problem isn't even the fact that I'm deaf. Do you know where I am getting at, @?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.wednesday.b": "...zzzZZzz...zzzZZzzz..$u #$e#...zzzZZzzzZZZZzz...$u #$e#Huh!? Where am I?$8 #$b#Oh, it's you @. Boy, am I relieved to smell you here. #$e#Hm? Uhh, about that, I guess I was having another nightmare.$6 #$b#It doesn't happen a lot, but when it does, it's hard to wake up.$6 #$b#...I'm not actually sure if I'm awake to be honest.$7 #$e#I'm fine. Nothing can really hurt me, you see. Much less little nightmares.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.thursday.a": "Nice to see you out here. #$e#Hm? Yeah. I guess you could say we're technically homeless. #$e#Still, that reminds me of what my mom said to me. #$b#That this entire planet is \"home\".$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.thursday.b": "Hmm, now that you thought of it, I can't sense or grasp the concept of light at all.$6 #$e#My eyes are actually perfectly functional. I'm blind in a sense that I literally can't process what my eyes see. Same goes for my hearing.$6 #$e#I get that it's not like that for living beings here. You don't need to ponder too much about it, even I wouldn't.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.friday.a": "So, do you always do something that involves %favorite or...? #$e#You don't have to elaborate if you don't want to.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.friday.b": "You haven't seen any other weird space aliens have you?$6 #$b#Report them to us. Most of the time they're fugitives from where we came from. #$b#Haha! And I'm saying that being a fugitive myself!$h #$b#But seriously, Fish is an officer back home, so make sure you tell us about it when you see any weirdos like us, alright?$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.saturday.a": "Tonight's saloon night. Join us if you want. I'll even get you something from the menu.$11 #$e#I'd gladly spoil my friends. Especially when I can only have so few in the span of eternity.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.saturday.b": "Say, @. Is that game Fish is so preoccupied about really that difficult?$6 #$e#Seeing as my kind are commonly believed to have superior senses over those of Earthlings, that gotta mean something, right? #$e#Ahahaha, then you better be real proud of yourself if you ever beat it! It's an insult not to!$h",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.sunday.a": "Hoo-wee! Another hot week.$11 #$b#Ice cream sure is a great pleasure this season. #$e#By the way, did you know you can buy ice cream even without its vendor? #$b#Fish went around the counter and I \"bought\" the ice cream.$11 #$e#I'm sure you can figure out how to get another living being to stand behind the counter, too.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.summer.sunday.b": "Is it gonna end yet?$6 #$e#Is it gonna end yet?$a #$e#Is it gonna end yet!?$13 #$e#I got a 1 out of 4 chance, right? Come one, @. Put your energy into it. One... Two...$a #$b#END ALREADY!!!$13",

	// Fall Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.monday.a": "Ahh, what a start of a new week.$11 #$b#You'll get tired of me saying it, but I'll keep saying it. Autumn is the best.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.monday.b": "I know I haven't expressed much negative emotions in the past. I didn't want to scare you or drive you away, y'know?$6 #$b#I want to be more honest with you. I want to express my grief, anger and discomfort more openly to you, because I trust you wouldn't just leave me, right @?$9 #$e#So, let's start with...$6 #$b#...how much I hate the way rabbits smell... geez, they're even worse than humans.$a",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.tuesday.a": "You know, it always feels like I'm dreaming. I fall asleep, and wake up somewhere else entirely.$6 #$b#And yet, I also keep 'waking' up here, in the same 'dream' where I can meet you. #$e#I don't know how to explain it. I guess whenever I'm snoring over here, I might be awake in some other 'dream'.$11 #$e#And maybe, in these many dreams, you'll smell a little different, or smell entirely different. #$b#But deep down, I know it's still the same ol' you. #$b#I know, I know, it all sounds silly, but that's just how it is for me.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.tuesday.b": "One time we got our order, Gus wondered if Oarfish's date is ever gonna come. #$b#Either that or he thinks Oarfish eats for two, which she is totally capable of doing, mind you.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.wednesday.a": "Hey @, I'm going to toss a coin. Tell me the result, okay?$9 #$b#%Remi tossed a coin. It landed on... #$b#%Oh, the coin rolled into a hole. #$e#...So? What's the result? #$b#Why aren't you answering...? @?$6 #$e#Well, either way. Tonight is gonna be painful...$7 #$b#Thanks for humoring me, @. See ya later.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.wednesday.b": "You smell more than usual. #$b#I mean, you smell more like the life you grow. You know, like soil and animals?$11 #$b#It's not a bad scent.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.thursday.a": "You know, we don't really need to sleep, eat, or even breathe at all. #$b#We can avoid pain altogether if we just don't but... I think existence like that is boring.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.thursday.b": "My friend, you are a rare treasure. Please take care of your yourself.$9 #$e#Maybe that was a selfish request. #$b#Yes, I do want you to live for as long as possible, so I can make the most memories possible with you.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.friday.a": "It's getting colder, so desires are getting warmer. #$e#I could go for some hot pumpkin soup right about now...$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.friday.b": "I feel bad for the monsters sometimes. Why do we call them monsters anyways?$6 #$e#If you're neither human nor animal, does that make you a monster?$6 #$e#Ehh, guess that technically makes me one too, huh? I actually don't mind that.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.saturday.a": "I'm not sure if the ordinary human can smell it, but you smell a lot like the forest magic that permeates this valley.$11 #$e#It's why I can stand you. Besides you being able to see and remember me and all that.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.saturday.b": "You know where to find us later, @. If you're free, let's feast on a pizza, play a few games, and drink the night away.$9 #$e#Wait, do you drink? ...ehhmm, I can't remember.$6 #$b#Well, we can skip the drinks if you don't want them.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.sunday.a": "I'm not sure if I told you about her yet... it's not Fish.$7 #$b#She's a really good friend from back home. I love her so much. #$e#...$s #$b#Oh, sorry. I'm tearing up a little thinking of her. Haha.$9 #$e#I know she still remembers me. Because I still remember her.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.fall.sunday.b": "Another Sunday, another goodbye.$11 #$b#And another hello to you, dear @. #$e#...What? Did I sound strange? #$b#Well, if you met me a few years ago...$9 #$e#This season is lovely. If only it never ends.",

	// Winter Done
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.monday.a": "Heya, so what do you do when crops don't grow this cold season? #$e#Invite me over sometime. I'd like to know how your farm smells like. Hehe.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.monday.b": "Brrr... man it stings...$6 #$b#@, I think I'm gonna freeze again. Could I borrow you for a bit?$9 #$e#%Just as she approaches you with open arms, she snap froze into place.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.tuesday.a": "I never would've bothered coming to Earth, honestly. The way humans smell is already a huge dealbreaker for me.$7 #$e#But here I am. Me and Fish against the rest of the world... except it's not like that anymore.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.tuesday.b": "Hey, so...$7 #$e#Do you think Fish likes Pierre... a little too much?$6 #$e#Nope. No way. Nah. He's just a novelty. He'll wear off her soon. Yup.$7",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.wednesday.a": "Large bodies of water are so scary, @. I've sensed plenty of desires that feel the same way, so I'm not alone on this one, right?$s #$b#Hahh, I just... I don't want to touch water at all...$13 #$e#%Remi started shivering in great intensity.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.wednesday.b": "I know I speak stupid most days, but before I left the garden for good and met my two friends, I actually speak pretty eloquently, almost flowery prose-like. #$e#So, if I all of a sudden sound smart, that's probably my past speech configuration randomly taking over, ehehehe.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.thursday.a": "Fish and I aren't really beings vulnerable to cold. If we wanted to, we can disable our senses to temperature.$6 #$e#But where's the fun in that? While we're here, we might as well experience everything, pain and all!$h #$b#Aa-$8 #$b#%AA-CHOOOO!",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.thursday.b": "A long time ago, my mom walked the Earth. #$e#You want me to continue? Okay. #$b#She's been everywhere, on the surface, underground, underwater... all to look for her special friend. #$e#Her friend's long dead, though... so it was all for nothing.$6 #$b#But I don't think I should say that. My mom learned to love this planet, and swore to protect it for as long as she lives.$11 #$b#Ain't you guys so lucky?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.friday.a": "%favorite!!!$h #$e#Hehehe, what? I just yelled what you desire most. #$b#Things I say are forgotten anyways, if that makes you feel any better.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.friday.b": "The tools you use that got you this far deserves your utmost appreciation. #$b#I know it's hard to believe, but even the alloys you sling around to do farmwork have faint desires, too.$11 #$e#Hm? Well, they're generally positive. Like wanting to be in their best conditions to help you succeed and such. #$b#You got a pretty nice set of tools.$9",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.saturday.a": "You ever wanted to borrow my coat or something? #$b#You know, for warmth. It's pretty chilly out.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.saturday.b": "*sigh*... I think I dug too deep and fell straight into lava yesterday. I still feel pretty toasty.$6 #$b#Well, at least I don't feel as cold today. You never know when unfortunate events are actually pretty fortunate.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.sunday.a": "Looks like all those weeks of talking to you and giving you gifts paid off. We're best buds now!$h #$e#...What? #$b#Oh right, of course your talking and gift-giving to me are also part of why I'm very fond of you.$11 #$e#I hope you've been doing the same with Fish. She and I want all three of us to be pals. #$e#It's really nostalgic... like how the three of us were back home.$9 #$b#Hm? No, we're not treating you as a replacement third member or anything. We love you for you.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.8.winter.sunday.b": "Hey, @. You're doing an amazing job staying alive for this long. I'm really proud of you.$9 #$e#What? I mean, isn't living by itself a praiseworthy thing?$6 #$e#We're immortal, but not indestructible. We can potentially live until the very ends of this universe but we'll never know if something destroys us to a point of irrecoverable damage so... #$b#Even for being like us, staying alive and conscious like this is something we can be grateful for each day. #$b#With that said...$11 #$b#Praise me! I'm doing a good job, too. Right, @?$h",


// 10 Hearts Dialogue //////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////


// Remi special dialogue on dated days "{{i18n:DIALOGUE.remi.{{season}}.{{day}}}}",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.spring.2": "My birthday?$6#$b#Yeah, I've heard of it from even way back home but we don't normally celebrate the day of our creation.#$e#Still, Fish and I decided to take a random day on the Earth calendar to fit in.#$e#And we'd react appropriately, too.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.spring.12": "Tomorrow's Egg Festival? Yeah, no thanks. Fish and I don't go to human events.#$e#You know me. I don't like the smell.$11#$b#And Oarfish, well... she's shy.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.spring.15": "You smell that? It's gonna be a free-for-all with all these berries ripe for the picking.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.summer.11": "There's an event being held at the beach?$6#$b#In that case, Fish will be staying with me here all day. You go have fun there, though.#$e#Fish is too shy to be in crowded places.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.summer.28": "Moonlight Jellies viewing?$6#$b#I'm good.#$e#Fish will be up here later. Too many people gathering in one place makes her nervous. Have I told you that?",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.fall.16": "A fair going on in town?$6#$b#Can't. Sorry.$11#$e#Actually, I think I could...#$b#Nevermind.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.fall.27": "Ooooh, spooky times.$11#$b#I'm not into dressing up, though. But the pumpkins smell great.#$e#Fish would love this time of the year, now if only her pranks aren't so... extreme. Hehe.$11",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.winter.8": "Fishing contest in the forest? Make us proud, @.#$e#Need a tip? Make sure you eat a fisher's meal to boost your performance. Always works.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.winter.25": "Nice of you to come and see me!$9#$b#Heh, you think I'd forget? Here's a present for you.[279]#$e#Been a great year, huh?",


// Remi Quizing her name on the 5th day of summer
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.summer.5": "Hmmm... #$q 10311001/10311002 summer_5_old#Surprise quiz. What's my name?#$r 10311001 50 summer_5_correct#It's Remi.#$r 10311002 0 summer_5_wrong#Remy?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.summer.5.old": "#$p 10311001#Oh, don't mind me. Just thinking what I should do in this summer heat.$11|Hehe... Oh, it's nothing. Just that a particular sewer rat came to mind.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.summer.5.correct": "That's right! Good job remembering my name, @. Now I know you're special, for sure.$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.summer.5.wrong": "Bzzz! Wrong. Of course I can tell the difference. Hehe.$11",


// Remi Rainy Dialogue
	"DIALOGUE.remi.rainy.a": "Rain or shine, I'm still gonna go around the valley.#$b#So don't be surprised if you catch me out walking in the rain.$11#$e#Fish is the same way. We're not bothered by rain at all.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.rainy.b": "Mmmm... do you smell that?$11#$e#Ahh, the smell of rain hitting the dry earth is so good.$u",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.rainy.c": "Watch your step, @.#$b#Don't want you to slip and have a head in worse condition than mine.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.rainy.d": "So, do you normally just charge into the rain and get all soaking wet like that?$6#$e#That's sick.#$e#Don't get sick, though.$6",


// Remi Engagement Dialogue
	"DIALOGUE.remi.engagement0": "You better watch for your snacks, though. Haha! Fish and I are gonna be double-teaming on those.$h",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.engagement1": "You having second thoughts? I mean, it's fine.#$b#I'll be over at your place soon if you haven't changed your mind.",


// Remi Proposal Acceptance DIALOGUE
	"DIALOGUE.remi.engaged": "...This texture.$10#$b#...$10#$b#Yeah! Yeah, I'll crash over at your place, for sure!$h#$e#Hey so, now that we're gonna be closer than ever, since I'll literally be living with you, can Fish come along?#$b#We'll be super chill roommates, I promise!$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.engagedRoommate": "...This texture.$10#$b#...#$b#Yeah! Yeah, I'll crash over at your place, for sure!$h#$e#Hey so, now that we're gonna be closer than ever, since I'll literally be living with you, can Fish come along?#$b#We'll be super chill roommates, I promise!$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.afterWedding": "Hey, I just got here. Don't mind me if I stumble around your place for a while.#$b#I'll get used to it pretty quickly, I think.$11",


// Remi Wedding Vows Fix (what Mayor Lewis is saying)
	"WEDDING.remi.1": "@... Remi... #$b#As the mayor of Pelican Town, I hereby grant official recognition of your platonic union!$h",
	"WEDDING.remi.2": "@... Remi... #$b#As the mayor of Pelican Town, I hereby grant official recognition of your platonic union!$h",
	"WEDDING.remi.3": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if he'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#Today, the town welcomes a new commune consisting of @ and er...#$b#*Whispers* What's her name again?$s#$b#Oh! Right. It's Remi.",
	"WEDDING.remi.4": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if she'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#Today, the town welcomes a new commune consisting of @ and er...#$b#*Whispers* What's her name again?$s#$b#Oh! Right. It's Remi.",
	"WEDDING.remi.5": "You may embrace.",
	"WEDDING.remi.6": "Life is going to be different from now on...",
	"WEDDING.remi.7": "...But the future looks bright!",


// Monsters in the FarmHouse
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked1": "Squishies!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked2": "Haha, go squish!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked3": "Well, this is fun!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked4": "Bye-bye!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked5": "Smells like candy!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked6": "Yum!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked7": "Haha, die!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked8": "Oooh! Slimey!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked9": "Squish!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked10": "*stomp!*",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked11": "Boo! Haha!",
	"FARMHOUSE.remi.SpouseAttacked12": "Awesome!",


// Remi Gift Reaction to specific items
	// LOVE Gifts
	"GIFT.remi.Beer.1": "Hey thanks! I really love this stuff.$9#$b#Don't worry. I'm a functional alcoholic. You'd be surprised of the kind of things I can get done while on a tipsy ride.",
	"GIFT.remi.Beer.2": "Ohh, that smell! I'm thirsty all of a sudden.$u#$b#Huh? It's for me?$10#$b#Well, thanks a lot!$9",
	"GIFT.remi.Beer.Birthday": "Birthday beer?$10#$b#Heck yeah! You're the best, @! Cheers!$h",

	"GIFT.remi.Mead.1": "You're giving this to me? Thanks!$h#$b#Mmm... smells amazing. Mead is something special, ain't it?$11",
	"GIFT.remi.Mead.Birthday": "I smell sweet and smooth honey brew...$11#$b#Oh! Mead for my birthday? Thanks!$h",

	"GIFT.remi.PaleAle.1": "Making good use of those hops, huh?#$b#Oh, it's for me? Thanks!$9",
	"GIFT.remi.PaleAle.Birthday": "Pale ale for a birthday gift? Heck yeah!$h#$b#I bet you made this one extra special to impress me. Let's just say you make me real proud.$9",

	"GIFT.remi.Wine.1": "Mmm, smells like fermented heaven.$11#$b#Oh, it's for me? Haha! Thank you! It means a lot that you're offering me some of your finest crafts.$h",
	"GIFT.remi.Wine.Birthday": "Fancy wine for me? Thank you! Now I know how I'll spend my birthday night with Fish.$9#$b#Heh, you're invited, y'know? Don't get all flustered, it's all casual stuff.",

	"GIFT.remi.Orange.1": "Orange!$h#$b#This brings back good memories. Thanks a lot.$11",
	"GIFT.remi.Orange.Birthday": "Orange! This brings back good memories!$h#$b#Thanks a lot. You made my day real special.$9#$e#Mmmm, reminds me of mommy...$u",

	"GIFT.remi.Pearl.1": "What is this... a salty jaw breaker?$6#$b#Huh? A pearl?$10#$b#A treasure of the sea, huh. I'll cherish it, thank you.",
	"GIFT.remi.Pearl.Birthday": "Huh? A birthday gift? How thoughtful. Thanks!$9#$b#It feels... cool and smooth, like Fi...#$b#...!$10#$b#Thanks again.$11",

	"GIFT.remi.CrabSticks.1": "Well well! Look who prepared the recipe I sent you.#$b#And it's for me? Thanks. Take a stick if you wanna.$9",
	"GIFT.remi.CrabSticks.Birthday": "Mmm, I can smell that lovely wasabi spice in the air...$u#$b#Oh, you actually made Crab Sticks.#$b#Eh? A birthday gift for me? Buddy, you're awesome! Thanks!$h",

	// LIKE Gifts
	"GIFT.remi.Flowers.1": "Aww, I love all kinds of flowers, thanks!$9#$e#I used to stay around a garden a lot, so this one brings back good memories.",
	"GIFT.remi.Flowers.Birthday": "Aww, I love all kinds of flowers, thanks!$9#$e#I used to stay around in a garden a lot, so this one brings back good memories.",
	"GIFT.remi.Fish.1": "Oh hey, I can make a decent sashimi with this one, thanks!$9#$e#...Or maybe some fish sticks. Or fish fillet...#$e#Mmmmmm...$u",
	"GIFT.remi.Cooking.1": "Mmmm, might as well try the human cuisine while I'm here, right? Thanks.$11",
	"GIFT.remi.Mineral.1": "...$6#$b#Hm? Oh it's nothing. Just checking if it's alive. Thanks.#$e#It doesn't contain any sort of consciousness if you're wondering. Which is a good thing.$11#$b#If we got one that's living, we'll have to take it back home for rescue. It's the least me and Fish could do for the fallen.",

	// NEUTRAL Gifts
	"GIFT.remi.MapleSyrup.1": "Hm? Oh, thanks.#$b#*Gulp*...!$10#$b#...$6#$b#Sweet.",
	"GIFT.remi.OakResin.1": "Hm? Oh, thanks.#$b#*Gulp*...!$10#$b#Huh? I'm not supposed to drink this? I guess you're right.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.PineTar.1": "Hm? Oh, thanks.#$b#*Gulp*...!$10#$b#Huh? I'm not supposed to drink this? I guess you're right.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Forage.1": "Oh, you're giving this to me?#$b#I can find a lot of these on the ground when I'm on my sniffing spree, but thanks anyways.$11",

	// HATE Gifts
	"GIFT.remi.JojaCola.1": "[167]No thanks. Even I know that drink is trash.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Trash.1": "[168]Take it out yourself.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Driftwood.1": "[169]Take it out yourself.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.BrokenGlasses.1": "[170]Take it out yourself.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.BrokenCD.1": "[171]Take it out yourself.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Soggy_Newspaper.1": "[172]Take it out yourself.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Trash.2": "[168]Too lazy to find the bin, kid?$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Driftwood.2": "[169]Too lazy to find the bin, kid?$6",
	"GIFT.remi.BrokenGlasses.2": "[170]Too lazy to find the bin, kid?$6",
	"GIFT.remi.BrokenCD.2": "[171]Too lazy to find the bin, kid?$6",
	"GIFT.remi.Soggy_Newspaper.2": "[172]Too lazy to find the bin, kid?$6",
	"GIFT.remi.RabbitsFoot.1": "...$a#$b#Oh, sorry. I almost puked.$6#$b#[446]Please have it back.$6",
	"GIFT.remi.RabbitsFoot.Birthday": "...$a#$b#Oh, sorry. I almost puked.$6#$b#[446]Please have it back.$6#$e#I really don't like the foot of... anything. Just so you know.$6",


// Remi repeatable Saloon Dialogue every Saturday after seeing 3 Heart Event with both Remi and Oarfish
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday": "Hey. #$q 10311003/10311004/10311005/10311006/10311007/10311008 Saloon_Sat_old#Want anything from the menu?#$r 10311003 0 Saloon_Sat_Beer#Beer would be nice.#$r 10311004 0 Saloon_Sat_Salad#A salad, please.#$r 10311005 0 Saloon_Sat_Spaghetti#Spaghetti sounds delicious.#$r 10311006 0 Saloon_Sat_Pizza#A whole pizza for the party.#$r 10311007 0 Saloon_Sat_Coffee#Just some coffee.#$r 10311008 0 Saloon_Sat_None#No thanks, I'm good.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.old": "Enjoying the night?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.Beer": "[346]Heh, here's your drink.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.Salad": "[196]Yum. Those leaves sure are crunchy.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.Spaghetti": "[224]Yummy spaghetti, am I right?.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.Pizza": "[206]I'll just have a slice if you don't mind.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.Coffee": "[395]Coffee at the saloon, eh? I like your style.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.saloon.saturday.None": "Hmm? Okay. You do you.",


// Remi stealing from Pierre repeatable Dialogue every Thursday
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday": "...It's hardly stealing if I'm only taking trash from Pierre's.$7#$q 10311011/10311012 Thu4Old#But if it'll affect our friendship then... I guess I'll quit it.#$r 10311011 20 ThuStopStealing#Yes. You should stop stealing from Pierre.#$r 10311012 30 ThuKeepStealing#Steal from Pierre all you want. Heck, take even the good stuff.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.old": "#$p 10311011#But since you told me not to, I won't take anything from his shop, rotting or not.|[245 246 247 419 423]Buuuut, I suppose it wouldn't hurt him too much if I take some... fresher goods. Hehehe.$12",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.stopStealing": "Yeah, gotcha.$9#$b#I'm glad we had this talk. I wouldn't want you to dislike me for it.#$b#...I mean, I can do whatever I want but our friendship has been going well so far, I think.$11#$b#Don't wanna put all that to waste.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.keepStealing": "Woah! Heck yeah, \"heard\" you loud and clear!$h#$b#You got beef with him or something? 'Cause I'm here for it.#$b#I won't be stealing to the point I ruin his livelihood, though. I mean, how can I steal from him if he had to close up shop?$11",


// Stealing from Pierre: Depends on choses response: 10311011 or 10311012
	// Response 10311011
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.stopStealing.a": "Hey, @.#$b#Hm? Yep. My hands are still clean.#$e#C'mon, didn't you tell me not to steal from Pierre anymore?$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.stopStealing.b": "[245 246 247 419 423]Here you go. Got that from a shop outside of town.#$e#What? You told me not to take from Pierre. So that's exactly what I did.#$e#Okay, fine fine. I didn't steal that, by the way. I got it very cheap from a bargain bin.$11#$b#Check the expiration date if it's still good, though. Don't wanna poison ya. I couldn't tell with the seal on.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.stopStealing.c": "Heya.#$e#...#$e#Okay, I'm guilty.$6#$e#Guilty of what? A petty crime.$11#$b#Although I promise, it's for a good cause. Something something hungry something...#$b#Fish can tell you the details!$9",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.stopStealing.d": "I'm not a thief!$8#$b#Huh, oh. It's just you, @.#$e#Why am I even panicking? It's not like they'll remember me.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.stopStealing.e": "You know, there's a reason why I do petty crimes on Earth.$6#$b#I try not to do so much that I ruin someone's life completely but...$7#$b#No, you're right. I'll try to keep clean.#$e#Being on Earth is a crime in itself already. Why do more, am I right?$9",

	// Response 10311012
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.keepStealing.a": "Hey, @.#$b#[245 246 247 419 423]Hehe, you think I'd forget? Here's your share.$12",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.keepStealing.b": "Howdy, pard'ner.$11#$b#May I interest you with some...#$b#[245 246 247 419 423]...questionably acquired goods? Hehe.$12#$e#What? Too much?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.question.thursday.keepStealing.c": "[245 246 247 419 423]Hey, @. Look what I gooot~$11#$e#Heh, petty crimes like these is exactly why I came to this planet.",


// Remi seen 7 hearts at the mines, lollipop offer
	"DIALOGUE.remi.mine.friday": "Oh, hey.#$q 10311020/10311021 Mine_Fri_old#I bought an extra lollipop from that merchant over there. Wanna have it?#$r 10311020 0 Mine_Fri_Yes#(Take the Miner's Treat)#$r 10311021 0 Mine_Fri_No#No thanks.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.mine.friday.old": "How's the mining going for ya?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.mine.friday.yes": "[243]Here you go!$9#$b#Pretty sweet, huh?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.mine.friday.no": "Not much of a sweet tooth, huh?#$b#More for me then.$11",


// Remi gifts every Wednesday after seeing 4th Heart event at Town
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.spring.3": "Happy new year!$9#$b#Erm, have I said that already? I can't tell.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.spring.10": "[289]Ermm...$6 #$b#Take it. I have no need for it.$6",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.spring.17": "[257]This mushroom smells uncommon. I figured you're into uncommon stuff. You can have it.#$e#Doing good this cherry-smelling season?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.spring.24": "What are you doing here? Aren't you supposed to be at the Flower Dance?$9#$b#Still, it's nice of you to come see me here.#$b#Going by the theme of flowers, I plucked this one out. You can have it.[421]$11#$e#What do you mean it's not in season yet?$6#$e#Semi-unrelated but... if you spot a green-haired woman wearing red plaid coming towards you, run.$6",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.summer.3": "[259]I found this one in the forest. I know you can make use of this.#$b#So, got any stories to tell? Had any adventures recently?$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.summer.10": "[266]Here, you can have this.#$b#So, wanna have a chat?#$e#What? You wondering where I got that?#$b#I go from place to place and stumble upon things sometimes. Probably from a community farm in another town.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.summer.17": "[88]Coconut!$9#$b#It's getting really warm. I figured there would be ripe coconuts outside of town.#$e#Got time to chat? Got work to do? Either way is fine.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.summer.24": "[90]Have a cactus fruit. Don't prick yourself.#$e#Come sit in the shade if you like.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.fall.3": "[613]It's apple season! I got these straight from a community orchard at another town. You can have this sweet-smelling one.$9#$b#Wanna sit and relax for a bit? It gets pretty dusty around here, though.",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.fall.10": "[637]Pom pom. Hehe, get it?$11#$b#Lame? Yeah, I agree with you.#$e#Got a story to tell? I'll listen.#$b#Yeah, even if I'm deaf I can lend you an ear. I have my ways.$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.fall.17": "[194]Umm, I tried frying an egg.$6#$b#Wildman style.#$e#I'd like to have access to an actual kitchen. Maybe then I can prepare you gourmet meals.#$e#You heard me. I can cook. Ever heard of deaf-blind chefs?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.fall.24": "[348]Wine!$h#$b#This one isn't as aged as the others, but it's ready to drink.#$e#So um, do you drink or... I should've asked that first, huh?$6#$b#You can always give it to someone else if you don't want it.",

	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.winter.3": "[446]Here's a mutilated foot of a small furry animal. They say it's lucky.#$e#...When I heard humans are into this stuff, I kinda gagged.$6#$e#How is it lucky anyways? The practice sounds too awful to be anything good.$7#$e#Sorry. I'm rambling too much.#$b#So, what about you? How are you doing in this cold season?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.winter.10": "[228]Maki Roll!$9#$b#Fish and I snuck in the Mayor's kitchen to make some meals.#$b#Don't worry. We brought in our own ingredients and cleaned up after ourselves.$11#$e#So uhh, is it still any good?",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.winter.17": "[444]Hm? No no, I didn't pluck this off of a poor duck. I found it on the ground outside of town.#$b#Texture's all nice, huh?$11",
	"DIALOGUE.remi.wednesdayGift.winter.24": "[445]Here's some fancy-schmancy caviar. Fish is great when it comes to harvesting roes... and pretty much anything fish-related.$11#$e#That would do great with fancy wine. You got kegs in your farm?#$e#I used to brew a lot of alcohol. It's pretty easy when time doesn't matter so much.$11",


