// Oarfish Wedding Vows Fix (what Mayor Lewis says)
	"WEDDING.oarfish.1": "@... Oarfish... #$b#As the mayor of Pelican Town, I hereby grant official recognition of your platonic union!$h",
	"WEDDING.oarfish.2": "@... Oarfish... #$b#As the mayor of Pelican Town, I hereby grant official recognition of your platonic union!$h",
	"WEDDING.oarfish.3": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if he'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#Today, the town welcomes a new commune consisting of @ and er...#$b#*Whispers* Is this right? Her name's really Oarfish?$s#$b#Ahem! Excuse me... of @ and Oarfish.",
	"WEDDING.oarfish.4": "When @ first arrived in Pelican Town, no one knew if she'd fit in with our community...#$b#But from this day forward, @ is going to be as much a part of this town as any of us!$h#$b#Today, the town welcomes a new commune consisting of @ and er...#$b#*Whispers* Is this right? Her name's really Oarfish?$s#$b#Ahem! Excuse me... of @ and Oarfish.",
	"WEDDING.oarfish.5": "You may embrace.",
	"WEDDING.oarfish.6": "Life is going to be different from now on...",
