	"MOVIE.remi.general.1.a": "...Yeah. I'm just gonna sit and be as quiet as possible. Okay?",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.1.b": "Hey, @. I brought a pillow with me just in case.",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.1.c": "*sniff* *sniff*$6#$b#Hope there wouldn't be too many people in there...$7",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.2": "(Remi fell asleep.)",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.3": "...zzzZzzZZzzzzz...$u",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.4.a": "Sorry I couldn't talk about the movie with you, but at least I got to accompany you, right?",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.4.b": "*Yaaawn* that was a nice, good nap.$11",
	"MOVIE.remi.general.4.c": "So uhh... how's the movie? Did you enjoy it?",

	"MOVIE.remi.whitelistOarfish.1": "Hey, I can smell Fish from here! Hehe, coming here was worth it!$h",
	"MOVIE.remi.whitelistOarfish.2": "(Remi is enjoying Oarfish's presence more than the movie...)",
	"MOVIE.remi.whitelistOarfish.3": "Mhmm hm hm...$l",
	"MOVIE.remi.whitelistOarfish.4": "Hehe, sorry about the drool.$11",

