// NPC ADVENTURES MOD - Dialogue, Speechbubbles, and Mail
	// REMI - Dialogue in places
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionAccepted": "Going somewhere? Lead the way.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionAccepted_Spouse": "Going somewhere? Lead the way.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionRecruited": "Don't mind me. Just sniffing my way around to catch up to you.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionRecruited_Spouse": "Don't mind me. Just sniffing my way around to catch up to you.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionRejected": "Nah.$6",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionRejectedNight": "Cant't. Sorry. Too late.$6",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionRejectedNight_Spouse": "Cant't. Sorry. Too late.$6 #$b#How about we sleep instead?",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionDismiss": "I'll be at my usual spot then.$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionDismiss_Spouse": "I'll be at home then.$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionDismissAuto": "Hey, I had fun, but I gotta go and get some sleep. See ya.$11",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionDismissAuto_Spouse": "Hey, I had fun, but I gotta go back and get some shut-eye. See you back home.$11",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionSuggest": "Hey,#$q -1 -1#Wanna go on a walk with me?#$r -1 0 Yes#Sure, let's go.#$r -1 0 No#Maybe not today, Remi.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionSuggest_Yes": "Great. You lead and I sniff up the good stuff, yeah?",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companionSuggest_No": "Booo... ah well. Maybe some other time, then.$11",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.giveForages": "Hey, I sniffed this one out for ya. You can have it.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_AdventureGuild": "Smells bloody and rugged in here... #$e#These humans smell more like the monsters they slay, which I like.$11",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_AdventureGuild~1": "You here to get gear? #$b#Hehe, get in gear. Get it? #$e#Okay, I'll stop.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_AnimalShop": "*sniff* *sniff*$6 #$b#Hay. #$e#Burnt hay.$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_ArchaeologyHouse": "Is this where you store your collection of treasures?$6 #$e#Each of them has a bit of your scent. Makes them yours, huh? #$e#Huh? Donated to the museum? So you say...$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Backwoods": "...$s #$e#Sorry. Just awful memories.$s",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Backwoods8": "So, been using the garden much?",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_BathHouse_Entry": "Eugh, this place reeks of residual body odor...$a #$e#The human smell just clings to the walls, you know?$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_BathHouse_MensLocker": "Bleugh...I think I'm gonna be sick...$13",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_BathHouse_Pool": "Huh, it's not that bad in here.$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_BathHouse_WomensLocker": "Bleugh...I think I'm gonna be sick...$13",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Beach": "...$8 #$e#...stay calm... stay calm...$8",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Beach~1": "Smells really salty around here. It's the ocean, for sure.$6",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Beach~2": "I hate the ocean. I'm scared of deep waters.$s #$e#Ah but, my friend is of the ocean so... I guess I love it, too. #$b#The beach makes me feel conflicted sometimes.$6",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Beach~3": "Despite my opinion of the ocean, the beach sand has a pretty nice texture.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Blacksmith": "Smells like sweat, soot, and regret.$6",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Blacksmith~1": "These are some... unhealthy desires.$6 #$e#Dunno if I should be disgusted or feel bad.$6 #$b#Eh, I can do both.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Club": "These are no ordinary humans. I can tell with the way they smell. #$e#So, ready to win big?$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Club~1": "I used to have like a couple hundred of those statues of fortune in one of my dreams. But now I've woken up.$6 #$e#It's not worth the investment, honestly. But if you're gunning for earning a million a day from these statues, good luck.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Club~2": "That guy smells unreachable.$6 #$e#Hm? Yeah. We're probably specks of dust to him. #$e#In the grand scheme of things, it's nothing to worry about.$11 #$b#Just do your best in everything you do, okay?",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Desert": "The desert got some pretty good and profitable spots. #$b#So, are we here for business, pleasure, or both?",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Desert~1": "We going in the caverns or what? I'm down for whatever.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Farm": "You got kegs around here? #$b#I'm a bit of an alcohol enthusiast myself.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Farm~1": "Your farm smells great.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Forest": "You smell more like the forest, which is why I can stand hanging out with you. #$b#With that said, the forest magic has welcomed you into its fold, huh? I'm sure you've seen and experienced things most humans haven't witnessed in their lifetimes.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Mine": "Focus on the ores. I got your back.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Mine~1": "...!!$8 #$e#...I smell a threat.$a",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Mine~2": "My friend has way better swordsmanship that I do. But I'm pretty decent, too. #$e#She kicks a lot of butt. #$b#Well, mostly my butt.$7",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Mine~3": "Hm? Yup. Me and Oarfish mine for a living. #$b#We don't need money to live, but sometimes we like the stuff we see. Well, stuff she sees anyways. #$e#We sell gems and ores for coin. That's about it.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Mountain": "Smells bountiful around here. #$b#I'll just keep sniffing around and maybe I'll find something you might want to keep.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Mountain~1": "I pass through this area a lot, so I should be familiar with its bounties.$11 #$e#The old guy who lives here? Yeah. I smell him around a lot. #$e#I don't mind him. Just like you he smells more like the forest.$11",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_QiNutRoom": "Congrats on making it this far. I can tell this is a pretty big deal to you.$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_QiNutRoom~1": "So, what challenge are you thinking of taking? #$b#If it's something dangerous, you can ask us to tag along, yeah?$11",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_QiNutRoom~2": "The most difficult challenge is also the least rewarding...$6 #$e#I bet Fish is fuming right now.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Railroad": "This place is where you'll usually find me. #$b#If I'm not here, then I'm probably where Oarfish is at. #$e#Where would she be then? Hmmm...$6 #$b#You can ask her.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Railroad_Spouse": "Hehe, my ol' friend.$11 #$b#How are ya, my favorite bench?",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Railroad_Spouse~1": "Remember when you found me here? I'll never forget it. #$e#Well, I try to.$6 #$b#Dunno when my head gets messy again but I'll hold onto your memory for as long as I can.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Saloon": "[346]Here, have a cold one. #$e#...or give it to someone else. I don't mind.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Saloon_Night": "[346]I got this for you. #$b#Cheers!$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Saloon_Night~1": "It gets pretty lively around here.$9 #$b#I'd enjoy it even more if humans don't stink too much. Good thing the smell of alcohol is stronger.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_SamHouse": "Hmmm... #$e#Hm? Oh no no. I wouldn't think of shoplifting here. #$e#Wouldn't want to get bombed to shreds, right?$9 #$b#Right?$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_SandyHouse": "Now this is where the money is at. Gotta love Sandy.$11",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_SeedShop": "Hm...$12 #$e#Huh? Oh, I'm just window shopping. Hehe.$11",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_SeedShop_Tuesday": "Eugh... Too many sweaty humans.$5 #$b#Let's just do our business and leave.$6",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_SeedShop_Wednesday^10": "He opens up on Wednesdays now?$6 #$b#Neat. #$e#Hm? Have I said that before? Guess I forgot.$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Sewer": "Hey! My ol' roommate lives here!$h #$b#He probably long forgotten about me since he and I went our separate ways, but I still care about him. #$e#Treat him nicely, okay?$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Sewer~1": "Mmmm... that humid smell makes me nostalgic.",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Sunroom": "Wow...$10 #$e#This place smells amazing. I genuinely love it here.$9",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Sunroom~1": "This is the most relaxing location I've ever been in.$9",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Town": "...Smells awful around here.$6 #$b#Especially that sweaty human over there.$7",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Town_Night": "The air feels cooler. I'm guessing it's nighttime? #$e#The fewer humans out and about, the better.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Town_winter": "Really cold out, but I'm okay. #$b#How about you?",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_Trailer_big": "The wood used to build this house has a bit of your scent in it. #$b#Say, @. You got something to do with this place?$9",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_WitchHut": "...$a #$b#Oh sorry. It's just that this place smells very dangerous.$6 #$e#Not in a life-threatening way. But more like how this place can really hurt me where it counts.$6 #$e#Just please be careful with what you touch here...$6",

	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_WizardHouse": "Smells... enchanted.",
	"npca.remi.dialogue.companion_WizardHouse~1": "Hehe, that guy smells a lot like petrichor",


